5251}, {\"lat\": 39.30219, \"lng\": -76.905875}, {\"lat\": 39.302143, \"lng\": -76.906518}, {\"lat\": 39.302115, \"lng\": -76.907217}, {\"lat\": 39.30211, \"lng\": -76.907691}, {\"lat\": 39.30213, \"lng\": -76.908271}, {\"lat\": 39.302187, \"lng\": -76.908971}, {\"lat\": 39.302284, \"lng\": -76.909815}]','Highly Awarded Basement Remodeling Company Near You','We service areas all across Howard County, including Ellicott City and Columbia. Our reliable team will guide you through the process from start to finish, through design, construction, and final touches. We take pride in our reliability and love to bring new life to homes across Maryland.\r\n<br><br>\r\nIf you reside in the above areas, our nearest warehouse to you is at 1680 East Gude Dr, STE 313, Rockville, MD 20850. That ensures quick turnaround and efficient execution of all your orders. \r\n<br><br> \r\nReady to get started? Schedule your free in-home consultation today to get your <b>basement remodel</b> underway!','Some Basement Finishing Ideas We Gathered for You','Your <b>basement idea</b> may include hardwood flooring to turn your space into a family room. You may want carpet so you can turn your basement into a comfortable gym. A basement renovation may include fixing bathroom furnishings, adding or replacing sinks, counters, tile and more. We can provide any specification you may have to your basement, floor to ceiling. Anything you dream of, we will make it a reality for you!\r\n',0,5,'Why we\'re the right choice for your next basement project','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v2_promo_compressed.mp4'),(3,'basement-finishing-area/va/fairfax/alexandria','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Alexandria, VA','Need a highly-rated basement remodeling and finishing contractor in Alexandria, VA? BasementRemodeling.com is the contractor with 15+ years of experience in the region!','basement, finishing, remodeling, alexandria, virginia, va, contractor, company, licensed, insured, certified, affordable, top-rated, experienced, egress windows, walkouts, custom engineering, family room, bathroom, bedroom, gym, home theater, double doors, HVAC, 3d designs, 3d models','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Alexandria, VA','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">We are Virginia\'s Most <strong>Trusted Basement Remodel Company</strong>. With 15+ years of experience in the basement renovation industry and 900+ completed projects, you can rely on our services!</span></p>','Hundreds of Basements Finished','Over 15 years as Alexandria, VA\'s premier basement finishing contractor, we have built an impressive portfolio. Please go through our completed projects to get ideas of what we are capable of.','BasementRemodeling.com was featured on House Smarts, which was aired on CNBC back in September of 2019. This basement is located in Potomac, MD, and was completed by BasementRemodeling.com (ex- Basement Masters) during the Spring of 2019 for Mr. and Mrs. Terlinsky. Our whole team thanks Alan and Joan for the opportunity to transform their dream of a smart basement into a reality.','The overwhelmingly positive reception from our clients makes BasementRemodeling.com stand out from other basement remodeling companies in Virginia. It definitely means something to us, and we think it should mean something to you, too!','Want to know what our past clients have to say about their basement remodeling experiences with BasementRemodeling.com?','We love our clients and they love us!','Licenses and Insurance','BasementRemodeling.com is a fully licensed and insured basement contractor in Maryland, Washington DC and Virginia. Our Virginia Class A Contractor License (VA Class A) number is 2705159425, our Maryland Home Improvement Commission License (MHIC) number is 129172 and our DC Class A Contractor License (DC Class A) number is 410516000631. We have posted copies of our basement remodeling licenses and insurance certificates below. Please note: any basement finishing or remodeling project requires a separate set of permits which should be pulled by a licensed contractor/electrician/plumber etc. You can easily check any contractors license here:','Follow us on Instagram','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/3/093215845b0b067a11fac1f8d44389ad','Schedule Your Consultation with BasementRemodeling.com Now For Basement Finishing in Alexandria, VA!','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Do you recall that empty room down there where you\'ve been storing old clothes, tools, and toys? What if BasementRemodeling.com turned it into a new workplace, a new home theatre, or a new billiard room?</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Whether you need a small or large basement makeover, a local, family-owned basement renovation company with a proven track record of community service can help.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Schedule your free in-home consultation now to have one of our representatives come to your home to go over your ideas and discuss your vision for the basement redesign.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">After you\'ve had your consultation, you\'ll know what to expect from the finished product that will be your brand new basement in Alexandria, VA.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">You can be confident that you will be kept informed throughout the process, and we will approach your <strong>basement finishing job</strong> in the same manner, we would approach a makeover in our own home.</span></p>','38.824698152727166','-77.08056702988281','10','2020-10-21 12:57:56','[{\"lat\": 38.8103569, \"lng\": -77.1443577}, {\"lat\": 38.8078732, \"lng\": -77.1437693}, {\"lat\": 38.8056245, \"lng\": -77.1432046}, {\"lat\": 38.8057601, \"lng\": -77.1423492}, {\"lat\": 38.800202, \"lng\": -77.1398609}, {\"lat\": 38.8007569, \"lng\": -77.1377413}, {\"lat\": 38.79816