 -77.1418627}, {\"lat\": 38.8241782, \"lng\": -77.1420045}, {\"lat\": 38.8238134, \"lng\": -77.1421578}, {\"lat\": 38.8238543, \"lng\": -77.1399957}, {\"lat\": 38.8238598, \"lng\": -77.1397604}, {\"lat\": 38.8238766, \"lng\": -77.1388403}, {\"lat\": 38.8238838, \"lng\": -77.1385137}, {\"lat\": 38.8236447, \"lng\": -77.1383813}, {\"lat\": 38.8231389, \"lng\": -77.1380996}, {\"lat\": 38.8227022, \"lng\": -77.1378586}, {\"lat\": 38.8215013, \"lng\": -77.1371898}, {\"lat\": 38.8195587, \"lng\": -77.1395786}, {\"lat\": 38.818708, \"lng\": -77.1384468}, {\"lat\": 38.8186579, \"lng\": -77.138511}, {\"lat\": 38.8182667, \"lng\": -77.1389923}, {\"lat\": 38.8171029, \"lng\": -77.1397444}, {\"lat\": 38.8172569, \"lng\": -77.1401241}, {\"lat\": 38.8171616, \"lng\": -77.1401926}, {\"lat\": 38.8175463, \"lng\": -77.1410453}, {\"lat\": 38.8151347, \"lng\": -77.1428951}, {\"lat\": 38.8142841, \"lng\": -77.1435499}, {\"lat\": 38.8141859, \"lng\": -77.1434851}, {\"lat\": 38.814119, \"lng\": -77.1436408}, {\"lat\": 38.8135878, \"lng\": -77.1436707}, {\"lat\": 38.8104225, \"lng\": -77.1438475}, {\"lat\": 38.8103569, \"lng\": -77.1443577}]','Virginia\'s Basement Remodeling Has Been Made Simple','Our emphasis is on timely execution and dependability, which is why we have many locations throughout Virginia, Washington, DC, and Maryland.<br><br>\r\nThis ensures that our crew has fast access to a warehouse near your home. You\'ll work directly with the team, who will keep you updated on the status of your basement makeover. When you hire us as <b>your basement contractor</b>, you\'ll get a transparent strategy, convenient construction, and comprehensive management.<br><br>\r\nGet a free estimate today to determine how much your basement renovation ideas in Virginia will cost.\r\n','Basement Remodeling Concepts That Are Unique To You','The sky is the limit when it comes to your <b>new basement renovation project</b>. You may let your personality shine through with creative floor patterns or wall treatments that make you feel at ease.<br><br>\r\nYou may add your personal touch to any place, whether it\'s a basement bar or a gym for after-work training.\r\nYou can build rails for better access or waterproof your basement to protect it from flooding; the choice is completely yours. <br><br>\r\nWith a competent and experienced staff on your side, you can turn your empty basement into anything your imagination can think up.<br><br>\r\nOur imaginative basement renovation ideas below can get you started in the right direction.',0,7,'Why You Should Choose Us For Your Basement Project','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v2_promo_compressed.mp4'),(4,'basement-finishing-area/md/anne-arundel/annapolis','Basement Finishing and Remodeling Services in Annapolis, MD','Expert Basement Remodeling and Finishing in Annapolis, MD. With 15 years of service, we know how to make your dream basement a reality.\r\n','basement, finishing, remodeling, annapolis, maryland, md, anne arundel, county, contractor, company, licensed, insured, certified, affordable, top-rated, experienced, egress windows, walkouts, custom engineering, family room, bathroom, bedroom, gym, home theater, double doors, HVAC, 3d designs, 3d models','Proven Basement Finishing and Remodeling Services in Annapolis, MD','<p>Awarded for our great service in the <strong>basement finishing</strong> industry, BasementRemodeling.com offers professional and efficient service to homeowners in the <strong>Annapolis, MD</strong> area.</p>','Browse Our Portfolio','Our <b>finished basement company</b> entered the industry in 2006 with the drive to deliver sophisticated and stylish basement renovation while maintaining a superior customer experience from start to finish. Today, our award-winning team is proud to say that we have kept that promise to our clients. Try clicking through our portfolio below to see how we are able to weave stellar craftsmanship and attention to detail in our work to create a space that is uniquely yours.','BasementRemodeling.com was featured on House Smarts, which was aired on CNBC back in September of 2019. This basement is located in Potomac, MD, and was completed by BasementRemodeling.com (ex- Basement Masters) during the Spring of 2019 for Mr. and Mrs. Terlinsky. Our whole team thanks Alan and Joan for the opportunity to transform their dream of a smart basement into a reality.','The overwhelmingly positive reception from our clients makes BasementRemodeling.com stand out from other basement remodeling companies in Maryland. It definitely means something to us, and we think it should mean something to you, too!','Want to know what our past clients have to say about their basement remodeling experiences with BasementRemodeling.com?','We love our clients and they love us!','Licenses and Insurance','BasementRemodeling.com is a fully licensed and insured basement contractor in Maryland, Washington DC and Virginia. Our Virginia Class A Contractor License (VA Class A) number is 2705159425, our Maryland Home Improvement Commission License (MHIC) number is 129172 and our DC Class A Contractor License (DC Class A) number is 410516000631. We have posted copies of our basement remodeling licenses and insurance certificates below. Please note: any basement finishing or remodeling project requires a separate set of permits which should be pulled by a licensed contractor/electrician/plumber etc. You can easily check any contractors license here:','Follow us on Instagram','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/4/e788bd6153daaa0fa3c02cf2230d0df9','What Makes Our Basement Finishing Company Stand Out?','<p>BasementRemodeling.com is a unique <strong>basement renovation contractor</strong> in that we take a catered, people-first approach to best serve our clients in Anne Arundel county and make their dreams a reality. But don&rsquo;t just take our word for it. BasementRemodeling.com has been featured on both Angie&rsquo;s List and Houzz for professional <strong>basement remodeling services</strong> to our customers. We&rsquo;ve even been recognized on <a href=\"../../../#awards\">Home Advisor for &ldquo;Elite Service&rdquo;</a> in the industry. We know how nerve-wracking it can be to start a big home project, especially when you&rsquo;re not sure where to start. We&rsquo;re here to help make it easier. We make sure you are comfortable and informed every step of the way, offsetting the potential for those unwanted surprises!</p>','38.9784453','-76.4921829','12','2020-10-21 13:03:45','[{\"lat\": 38.9773813, \"lng\": -76.5395832}, {\"lat\": 38.9773574, \"lng\": -76.5395382}, {\"lat\": 38.9773422, \"lng\": -76.5395498}, {\"lat\": 38.9768255, \"lng\": -76.5384649}, {\"lat\": 38.9767593, \"lng\": -76.538375}, {\"lat\": 38.9767285, \"lng\": -76.5383589}, {\"lat\": 38.9766705, \"lng\": -76.5383286}, {\"lat\": 38.9766227, \"lng\": -76.5383746}, {\"lat\": 38.9763035, \"lng\": -76.5378043}, {\"lat\": 38.9757967, \"lng\": -76.5382771}, {\"lat\": 38.9748073, \"lng\": -76.536752}, {\"lat\": 38.9744983, \"lng\": -76.5370869}, {\"lat\": 38.9744314, \"lng\": -76.5371526}, {\"lat\": 38.9740442, \"lng\": -76.5375589}, {\"lat\": 38.9735558, \"lng\": -76.5368107}, {\"lat\": 38.9738396, \"lng\": -76.5366663}, {\"lat\": 38.9740715, \"lng\": -76.5363963}, {\"lat\": 38.9744908, \"lng\": -76.5359508}, {\"lat\": 38.9744972, \"lng\": -76.5359611}, {\"lat\": 38.9748941, \"lng\": -76.5355553}, {\"lat\": 38.9749613, \"lng\": -76.5353961}, {\"lat\": 38.9746571, \"lng\": -76.535042}, {\"lat\": 38.9733483, \"lng\": -76.5349467}, {\"lat\": 38.972742, \"lng\": -76.5349118}, {\"lat\": 38.9727286, \"lng\": -76.535578}, {\"lat\": 38.9726188, \"lng\": -76.5355725}, {\"lat\": 38.9725827, \"lng\": -76.5355934}, {\"lat\": 38.9725547, \"lng\": -76.535601}, {\"lat\": 38.9716007, \"lng\": -76.535632}, {\"lat\": 38.9708051, \"lng\": -76.5354045}, {\"lat\": 38.9699346, \"lng\": -76.535355}, {\"lat\": 38.9699339, \"lng\": -76.533417