dedicated hobby room? If you love music, perhaps you’re considering an at-home studio. Or maybe you’re more keen on an at-home workout facility to ultimately eliminate that commute to the gym! Our <b>basement finishing company</b> can handle anything and we’ll work with you to make sure that your vision is realized. ',0,4,'We\'re Proud Of Our Accomplishments - See What We\'ve Achieved','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v1_promo_compressed.mp4'),(5,'basement-finishing-area/va/arlington/','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Arlington, VA','Since 2006, BasemetRemodeling.com has rebuilt, renovated, and completed basements in Washington, D.C., Virginia, and Maryland.\r\nWith 15 years of expertise and over 900+ completed projects under their belt, this family-run and locally-owned firm is one you can rely on to alter your life and your basement!','basement, finishing, remodeling, arlington, virginia, va, county, contractor, company, licensed, insured, certified, affordable, top-rated, experienced, egress windows, walkouts, custom engineering, family room, bathroom, bedroom, gym, home theater, double doors, HVAC, 3d designs, 3d models','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Arlington, VA','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Reliable finished basement services</strong> from licensed and skilled remodeling professionals for your next renovation project. Basement Contractor with 15+ Years of Experience Serving the Arlington County Area.</span></p>','Experienced Basement Remodeling Contractor','Since 2006, we\'ve worked hard to make our clients\' dreams a reality, winning us the Houzz \"best of customer service\" award and <a href=../../../../../about-us/reviews />several other awards </a>.<br><br>\r\nWe are proud of our extensive finished basement portfolio with over 15 years of expertise as a finished basement company. Investigate what we\'ve done for our client; your basement may be next!','BasementRemodeling.com was featured on House Smarts, which was aired on CNBC back in September of 2019. This basement is located in Potomac, MD, and was completed by BasementRemodeling.com (ex- Basement Masters) during the Spring of 2019 for Mr. and Mrs. Terlinsky. Our whole team thanks Alan and Joan for the opportunity to transform their dream of a smart basement into a reality.','The overwhelmingly positive reception from our clients makes BasementRemodeling.com stand out from other basement remodeling companies in Virginia. It definitely means something to us, and we think it should mean something to you, too!','Want to know what our past clients have to say about their basement remodeling experiences with BasementRemodeling.com?','We love our clients and they love us!','Licenses and Insurance','BasementRemodeling.com is a fully licensed and insured basement contractor in Maryland, Washington DC and Virginia. Our Virginia Class A Contractor License (VA Class A) number is 2705159425, our Maryland Home Improvement Commission License (MHIC) number is 129172 and our DC Class A Contractor License (DC Class A) number is 410516000631. We have posted copies of our basement remodeling licenses and insurance certificates below. Please note: any basement finishing or remodeling project requires a separate set of permits which should be pulled by a licensed contractor/electrician/plumber etc. You can easily check any contractors license here:','Follow us on Instagram','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/5/b44005018afb696b23eccead1ce5ef7c','The Best Basement Remodeling and Finishing Services in all of Arlington County','<div class=\"lend-text-brief\">\r\n<div class=\"brief\">\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">BasementRemodeling.com offers one-of-a-kind basement finishing and renovation services. You\'ll be working with the <strong>best basement contractor</strong>, with a rigorous devotion to quality and expertise, backed by years of hard work and experience!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">When you schedule a consultation with our basement remodeling firm, the process of creating a stunning basement restoration begins.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Our consultant will work with you on the designs for the basement, after which you will be assigned a dedicated team to execute that vision. We will guarantee that your home\'s privacy is preserved once the basement remodeling begins.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>','38.8799697','-77.1067698','12','2020-10-21 13:08:28','[{\"lat\": 38.8903961, \"lng\": -77.0841585}]','Basement Remodeling Locations in Arlington County and it\'s Cities','As a basement finishing firm, we\'ve worked on basement makeovers in Arlington County, as well as neighboring municipalities, for many years.\r\nOur warehouses may be found across the Northern Virginia, with one conveniently positioned near your Hampton home to make your home improvement easier.<br><br>\r\nWe cover the whole DMV region and are eager to assist you with <b>any basement remodel</b>, large or small. \r\nIf you\'re ready to get started, get your online quote now to get an idea of the expenses, and then set up your in-home consultation!','A collection of <b>inspiring basement ideas</b>, hand-picked for you','Basements can be so much more than just additional storage. You may transform a basement into anything, such as an additional bedroom, a kitchen, or a music area. Or perhaps the gym you\'ve always wanted! To complement your taste, you may pick from various floor patterns and wall treatments when constructing your new wet bar or kid\'s playroom. \r\nWe can waterproof your basement and install amenities such as egress windows in addition to furnishing it with columns and railing. <br><br>\r\nExplore the hand-picked images of our basement ideas to get a sense of what you want to be done to your basement, and we\'ll work with you to make it happen! \r\nWe have earned only the highest ratings for our <b>basement renovation services</b> so you won\'t be disappointed.',0,7,'Why We\'re the Right Choice For Your Basement Project','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v2_promo_compressed.mp4'),(6,'basement-finishing-area/va/loudoun/ashburn','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Ashburn, VA','Tired of settling for mediocre basement remodeling and finishing services in Ashburn, VA? Try BasementRemodeling.com—we\'re all about basements.','basement, finishing, remodeling, ashburn, virginia, va, loudoun, county, contractor, company, licensed, insured, certified, affordable, top-rated, experienced, egress windows, walkouts, custom engineering, family room, bathroom, bedroom, gym, home theater, double doors, HVAC, 3d designs, 3d models','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Ashburn, VA — Bring Your Basement Space to Life','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">A skilled and structured approach to your <strong>basement finishing job </strong>from a local, family-owned basement remodeling company in Ashburn, Virginia.</span></p>','900+ Basements Remodeled','BasementRemodeling.com has been offering <b>basement remodeling services for more than 15 years</b>, and in that duration, we\'ve completed over 900 basement finishing jobs, some of which were located right here in Ashburn, Virginia.','BasementRemodeling.com was featured on House Smarts, which was aired on CNBC back in September of 2019. This basement is located in Potomac, MD, and was completed by BasementRemodeling.com (ex- Basement Masters) during the Spring of 2019 for Mr. and Mrs. Terlinsky. Our whole team thanks Alan and Joan for the opportunity to transform their dream of a smart basement into a reality.','The overwhelmingly positive reception from our clients makes Basement Remodeling Company stand out from other basement remodeling companies in Maryland. It definitely means something to us, and we think it should mean something to you, too!','Want to know what our past clients have to say about their basement remodeling experiences with Basement Remodeling Company?','We love our clients and they love us!','Licenses and Insurance','BasementRemodeling.com is a fully licensed and insured basement contractor in Maryland, Washington DC and Virginia. Our Virginia Class A Contractor License (VA Class A) number is 2705159425, our Maryland Home Improvement Commission License (MHIC) number is 129172 and our DC Class A Contractor License (DC Class A) number is 410516000631. We have posted copies of our basement remodeling licenses and insurance certificates below. Please note: any basement finishing or remodeling project requires a separate set of permits which should be pulled by a licensed contractor/electrician/plumber etc. You can easily check any contractors license here:','Follow us on Instagram','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/6/751d7819ab694db5f9e94b04b137a986','Basement Remodeling That Will Change Your Life – Now in Ashburn, VA','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">BasementRemodeling.com provides its services all across the US, including Ashburn, VA! Our extensive experience since 2006 ensures that we deliver only the best in the basement remodeling business.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Our customers can attest to this by checking out reviews about our company on various websites such as Angie\'s List, HomeAdvisor, Yelp, etc.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Just because you have a basement you don\'t like doesn\'t mean you can\'t change it. Make your space your own again with BasementRemodeling.com<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> as <strong>your basement contractor</strong>.</span></span></p>','39.0437567','-77.4874416','9','2020-10-27 14:09:56','[{\"lat\": 39.0371541, \"lng\": -77.52279}, {\"lat\": 39.037018, \"lng