ashington DC and Virginia. Our Virginia Class A Contractor License (VA Class A) number is 2705159425, our Maryland Home Improvement Commission License (MHIC) number is 129172 and our DC Class A Contractor License (DC Class A) number is 410516000631. We have posted copies of our basement remodeling licenses and insurance certificates below. Please note: any basement finishing or remodeling project requires a separate set of permits which should be pulled by a licensed contractor/electrician/plumber etc. You can easily check any contractors license here:','Follow us on Instagram','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/14/99e959ad99c58f9d62753292eea9e4f4','The Best Basement Finishing Company, Now Serving Gaithersburg, MD','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Hundreds of satisfied customers have been kind enough to supply us with their <a href=\"../../../about-us/reviews/\">honest feedback</a> on our work: we are proud to showcase it as a testament to our quality of work and dedication..<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">If you\'re still wondering why you should use our <strong>basement finishing services</strong>, here is why:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span class=\"s1\">Our warehouses are close to our clients, and we can provide them with quick service.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span class=\"s1\">Before your project, we can establish and adhere to an appropriate timeframe!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span class=\"s1\">Your project manager is always a phone call or email away for any questions you may have throughout the process.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span class=\"s1\">We take pleasure in our reputation for award-winning basement renovation services and industry openness. Our website has all of our relevant insurance papers and certification.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Book a consultation now to get started on your journey of making your basement your own again.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>','39.1439689','-77.2016062','10','2020-10-27 14:50:18','[{\"lat\": 39.1206978, \"lng\": -77.2582727}, {\"lat\": 39.1185019, \"lng\": -77.257294}, {\"lat\": 39.1184977, \"lng\": -77.2572357}, {\"lat\": 39.1183927, \"lng\": -77.2558175}, {\"lat\": 39.1184145, \"lng\": -77.2558158}, {\"lat\": 39.1183391, \"lng\": -77.2548334}, {\"lat\": 39.1182964, \"lng\": -77.2542889}, {\"lat\": 39.1182652, \"lng\": -77.2539034}, {\"lat\": 39.1182376, \"lng\": -77.2536546}, {\"lat\": 39.1182075, \"lng\": -77.2534333}, {\"lat\": 39.1181653, \"lng\": -77.2531812}, {\"lat\": 39.1181457, \"lng\": -77.2530719}, {\"lat\": 39.1178621, \"lng\": -77.2531441}, {\"lat\": 39.1173042, \"lng\": -77.2529764}, {\"lat\": 39.1165623, \"lng\": -77.252978}, {\"lat\": 39.1165252, \"lng\": -77.2527907}, {\"lat\": 39.1161154, \"lng\": -77.251204}, {\"lat\": 39.1171033, \"lng\": -77.2507948}, {\"lat\": 39.1171405, \"lng\": -77.2509107}, {\"lat\": 39.1168029, \"lng\": -77.2510902}, {\"lat\": 39.116875, \"lng\": -77.2513389}, {\"lat\": 39.1175175, \"lng\": -77.2509987}, {\"lat\": 39.116921, \"lng\": -77.2491606}, {\"lat\": 39.1168639, \"lng\": -77.249196}, {\"lat\": 39.116474, \"lng\": -77.2479563}, {\"lat\": 39.1162903, \"lng\": -77.2474624}, {\"lat\": 39.1159702, \"lng\": -77.2466969}, {\"lat\": 39.1159705, \"lng\": -77.2465378}, {\"lat\": 39.1158605, \"lng\": -77.2461779}, {\"lat\": 39.1157562, \"lng\": -77.2459626}, {\"lat\": 39.1154216, \"lng\": -77.2452969}, {\"lat\": 39.1152934, \"lng\": -77.2450597}, {\"lat\": 39.1151837, \"lng\": -77.2448666}, {\"lat\": 39.1150212, \"lng\": -77.2446042}, {\"lat\": 39.1139325, \"lng\": -77.2428959}, {\"lat\": 39.113817, \"lng\": -77.2427267}, {\"lat\": 39.1134149, \"lng\": -77.2421107}, {\"lat\": 39.1133402, \"lng\": -77.24