ions based on your space. BasementRemodeling.com has helped its clients with a variety of <b>basement transformations</b>, from family entertainment rooms and playrooms to wine cellars and music spaces. For even more assistance in creating your dream space, consider enlisting our Interior Decorating Team for the full <b>basement renovation</b> experience! The possibilities really are endless. Check out some of our clients\' reviews or see the design ideas below.',0,4,'The Best Choice for Your Basement Finishing Project','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v1_promo_compressed.mp4'),(17,'basement-finishing-area/va/fairfax/great-falls','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Great Falls, VA','Need exceptional basement remodeling and finishing services in Great Falls, VA? BasementRemodeling.com is the contractor to depend on!','basement, finishing, remodeling, great falls, virginia, va, fairfax, county, contractor, company, licensed, insured, certified, affordable, top-rated, experienced, egress windows, walkouts, custom engineering, family room, bathroom, bedroom, gym, home theater, double doors, HVAC, 3d designs, 3d models','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Great Falls, VA','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">We are a fully insured and licensed finished <strong>basement company</strong> with over a decade of experience serving Great Falls, VA. A professional and coordinated approach to your basement remodel from a local, family-owned business.</span></p>','More than 900 Basement Remodels Since 2006','We take delight in displaying our work: a new workplace or an improved living space, we have done it all! \r\nWhether you want to transform your basement into a children’s playroom, a guest bedroom, a gaming room or anything else under the sun, BasementRemdoeling.com can make it come to life!<br><br>\r\nSee our most current basement finishing and renovation work for yourself.','BasementRemodeling.com was featured on House Smarts, which was aired on CNBC back in September of 2019. This basement is located in Potomac, MD, and was completed by BasementRemodeling.com (ex- Basement Masters) during the Spring of 2019 for Mr. and Mrs. Terlinsky. Our whole team thanks Alan and Joan for the opportunity to transform their dream of a smart basement into a reality.','The overwhelmingly positive reception from our clients makes Basement Remodeling Company stand out from other basement remodeling companies in Maryland. It definitely means something to us, and we think it should mean something to you, too!','Want to know what our past clients have to say about their basement remodeling experiences with Basement Remodeling Company?','We love our clients and they love us!','Licenses and Insurance','BasementRemodeling.com is a fully licensed and insured basement contractor in Maryland, Washington DC and Virginia. Our Virginia Class A Contractor License (VA Class A) number is 2705159425, our Maryland Home Improvement Commission License (MHIC) number is 129172 and our DC Class A Contractor License (DC Class A) number is 410516000631. We have posted copies of our basement remodeling licenses and insurance certificates below. Please note: any basement finishing or remodeling project requires a separate set of permits which should be pulled by a licensed contractor/electrician/plumber etc. You can easily check any contractors license here:','Follow us on Instagram','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/17/b40cd9cba7e3d2c6feee48f1d5e97687','Great Falls, VA — Dependable Basement Finishing and Remodeling','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">We take pleasure in offering modern basement remodeling solutions to basements around Great Falls, VA, as a <strong>leading basement finishing contractor</strong>.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">We offer knowledge and inventive basement ideas to ensure that your basement renovation succeeds.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"s1\">Basement remodeling does not have to be a hassle since we will work with you to create the ideal place for your house from start to finish.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Trust our team, and we will provide design and construction excellence that no other basement company can match.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Click the button below to learn more about what we do, how we do it, and why we\'re the business you\'ve been looking for!</span></p>','38.9981652','-77.2883157','11','2020-10-27 15:05:47','[{\"lat\": 39.032358, \"lng\": -77.34136}, {\"lat\": 39.03228, \"lng\": -77.340846}, {\"lat\": 39.032198, \"lng\": -77.340222}, {\"lat\": 39.0321424, \"lng\": -77.3397425}, {\"lat\": 39.032069, \"lng\": -77.339109}, {\"lat\": 39.031985, \"lng\": -77.338431}, {\"lat\": 39.031867, \"lng\": -77.337497}, {\"lat\": 39.031844, \"lng\": -77.337382}, {\"lat\": 39.031812, \"lng\": -77.337277}, {\"lat\": 39.031771, \"lng\": -77.337191}, {\"lat\": 39.03171, \"lng\": -77.337097}, {\"lat\": 39.031632, \"lng\": -77.337004}, {\"lat\": 39.031468, \"lng\": -77.336854}, {\"lat\": 39.031449, \"lng\": -77.336837}, {\"lat\": 39.031281, \"lng\": -77.336692}, {\"lat\": 39.030984, \"lng\": -77.336455}, {\"lat\": 39.030893, \"lng\": -77.336361}, {\"lat\": 39.03085, \"lng\": -77.336298}, {\"lat\": 39.030832, \"lng\": -77.336254}, {\"lat\": 39.030824, \"lng\": -77.336184}, {\"lat\": 39.030832, \"lng\": -77.336118}, {\"lat\": 39.030853, \"lng\": -77.33607}, {\"lat\": 39.030898, \"lng\": -77.336016}, {\"lat\": 39.030932, \"lng\": -77.335988}, {\"lat\": 39.031153, \"lng\": -77.335863}, {\"lat\": 39.031335, \"lng\": -77.335775}, {\"lat\": 39.031444, \"lng\": -77.335705}, {\"lat\": 39.0315, \"lng\": -77.335648}, {\"lat\": 39.031532, \"lng\": -77.335602}, {\"lat\": 39.031568, \"lng\": -77.335522}, {\"lat\": 39.031588, \"lng\": -77.335443}, {\"lat\": 39.0