 <b>basement ideas</b> that are currently trending for you to go through and see which of these concepts would fit your space. There are so many options to choose from!<br><br>\r\nFor example, hardwood flooring might be part of your basement plan if you want to make it into a family area. Or you could desire carpet so that you can convert your basement into a comfy playroom. <br><br>\r\nWe can meet whatever specifications you have for your basement, from floor to ceiling. Anything you can imagine, as your basement remodeling contractor, we will make it a reality for you!',0,7,'The Benefits of Choosing Basementremodeling.com','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v2_promo_compressed.mp4'),(18,'basement-finishing-area/va/loudoun/hamilton','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Hamilton, VA','Need basement finishing and remodeling services that are backed by distinct architectural and engineering designs? BasementRemodeling.com is the contractor you need!','basement, finishing, remodeling, hamilton, virginia, va, loudoun, county, contractor, company, licensed, insured, certified, affordable, top-rated, experienced, egress windows, walkouts, custom engineering, family room, bathroom, bedroom, gym, home theater, double doors, HVAC, 3d designs, 3d models','Reimagined Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Hamilton, VA','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">An innovative approach to <strong>basement remodeling and finishing</strong> projects from a highly experienced, local, family-owned business. We can transform any basement into your dream space.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>','Transforming Basements Since 2006','In the 15 years, that we have been in business, BasementRemodeling.com has changed the lives of all its clients with <b>high-quality basement finishing services</b>. We have worked on over 900 projects – some right here in Hamilton, VA. This means we have over 900 clients who can attest to the quality of our basement finishing contractors.','BasementRemodeling.com was featured on House Smarts, which was aired on CNBC back in September of 2019. This basement is located in Potomac, MD, and was completed by BasementRemodeling.com (ex- Basement Masters) during the Spring of 2019 for Mr. and Mrs. Terlinsky. Our whole team thanks Alan and Joan for the opportunity to transform their dream of a smart basement into a reality.','The overwhelmingly positive reception from our clients makes Basement Remodeling Company stand out from other basement remodeling companies in Maryland. It definitely means something to us, and we think it should mean something to you, too!','Want to know what our past clients have to say about their basement remodeling experiences with Basement Remodeling Company?','We love our clients and they love us!','Licenses and Insurance','BasementRemodeling.com is a fully licensed and insured basement contractor in Maryland, Washington DC and Virginia. Our Virginia Class A Contractor License (VA Class A) number is 2705159425, our Maryland Home Improvement Commission License (MHIC) number is 129172 and our DC Class A Contractor License (DC Class A) number is 410516000631. We have posted copies of our basement remodeling licenses and insurance certificates below. Please note: any basement finishing or remodeling project requires a separate set of permits which should be pulled by a licensed contractor/electrician/plumber etc. You can easily check any contractors license here:','Follow us on Instagram','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/18/4cc640e4da66fd3e160358e213c09dc4','Worry-Free Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Hamilton, VA','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">BasementRemodeling.com offers basement renovation and finishing services in Hamilton, Virginia (Loudoun County). We have over a decade of experience, are completely licensed and insured, and have a well-educated and competent workforce. You won\'t have to worry about anything with BasementRemodeling.com taking care of your basement renovation!&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Homeowners of Hamilton, VA, this is your chance to get your basement the makeover you have always dreamed of! Just use our online-quote tool below to get an idea of the pricing, or schedule your free in-home consultation right away and our project consultant will visit your home to go over your plans.</span></p>','39.1342719','-77.662492','11','2020-10-27 15:08:28','[{\"lat\": 39.1387045, \"lng\": -77.6722309}, {\"lat\": 39.1363049, \"lng\": -77.672093}, {\"lat\": 39.135262, \"lng\": -77.6719605}, {\"lat\": 39.1351598, \"lng\": -77.6710495}, {\"lat\": 39.1351295, \"lng\": -77.6708104}, {\"lat\": 39.1350501, \"lng\": -77.6700721}, {\"lat\": 39.1350079, \"lng\": -77.6700223}, {\"lat\": 39.1348027, \"lng\": -77.6696928}, {\"lat\": 39.1347707, \"lng\": -77.6695572}, {\"lat\": 39.1347249, \"lng\": -77.6695609}, {\"lat\": 39.1347189, \"lng\": -77.6695519}, {\"lat\": 39.1346676, \"lng\": -77.6689578}, {\"lat\": 39.1340018, \"lng\": -77.6677306}, {\"lat\": 39.1332601, \"lng\": -77.6654931}, {\"lat\": 39.1331027, \"lng\": -77.6650066}, {\"lat\": 39.1329501, \"lng\": -77.6645559}, {\"lat\": 39.132697, \"lng\": -77.6647196}, {\"lat\": 39.1323839, \"lng\": -77.6649398}, {\"lat\": 39.1322127, \"lng\": -77.6650702}, {\"lat\": 39.1320646, \"lng\": -77.6651736}, {\"lat\": 39.1317393, \"lng\": -77.6646682}, {\"lat\": 39.1323768, \"lng\": -77.6642576}, {\"lat\": 39.132334, \"lng\": -77.6641669}, {\"lat\": 39.1320953, \"lng\": -77.663697}, {\"lat\": 39.1331055, \"lng\": -77.6629949}, {\"lat\": 39.1330976, \"lng\": -77.6629359}, {\"lat\": 39.1328153, \"lng\": -77.6623664}, {\"lat\": 39.1326584, \"lng\": -77.6621191}, {\"lat\": 39.1322898, \"lng\": -77.6614176}, {\"lat\": 39.1321168, \"lng\": -77.6607829}, {\"lat\": 39.132017, \"lng\": -77.6603767}, {\"lat\": 39.131777, \"lng\": -77.6593325}, {\"lat\": 39.1317467, \"lng\": -77.6592193}, {\"lat\": 39.1317028, \"lng