bathrooms, bedrooms, storage spaces, wet bars, kids’ playrooms, music rooms, gyms, office spaces, wine cellars, laundry rooms and media rooms, and the list continues to grow. We work with you to include the features that you want, including custom flooring, built-in shelving, stairwells and even beautiful wall-treatment designs. We want to deliver <b>finished basement</b> that exceeds your expectations. Remodeling basements is our passion, so let us help you design your new space today.  ',0,6,'Why You Should Choose Us For Your basement Project','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v1_promo_compressed.mp4'),(30,'basement-finishing-area/md/baltimore/timonium','Licensed Basement Remodeling Company in Lutherville Timonium, Maryland','Have a basement remodeling or finishing job you need to get done quickly and accurately? Contact BasementRemodeling.com today for a free in-home consultation!','basement, finishing, remodeling, timonium, maryland, md, baltimore, county, contractor, company, licensed, insured, certified, affordable, top-rated, experienced, egress windows, walkouts, custom engineering, family room, bathroom, bedroom, gym, home theater, double doors, HVAC, 3d designs, 3d models','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Lutherville Timonium, MD','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Licensed and Award-Winning <strong>Basement Contractor</strong> with 15+ Years of Experience Serving Lutherville-Timonium Area.&nbsp;</span></p>','900+ Basement Renovations and Counting','With 15+ years of experience as a <b>finished basement company</b>, we are proud of our rich portfolio of finished basements. Explore what we have done for our client, and your basement could be next!','BasementRemodeling.com was featured on House Smarts, which was aired on CNBC back in September of 2019. This basement is located in Potomac, MD, and was completed by BasementRemodeling.com (ex- Basement Masters) during the Spring of 2019 for Mr. and Mrs. Terlinsky. Our 