: 38.9911711, \"lng\": -77.0471058}, {\"lat\": 38.9892718, \"lng\": -77.0495365}, {\"lat\": 38.987017, \"lng\": -77.052422}, {\"lat\": 38.9861063, \"lng\": -77.0535876}, {\"lat\": 38.9854029, \"lng\": -77.0544877}, {\"lat\": 38.9738918, \"lng\": -77.0692172}, {\"lat\": 38.9737631, \"lng\": -77.0693818}, {\"lat\": 38.9650935, \"lng\": -77.0804738}, {\"lat\": 38.9637264, \"lng\": -77.0822227}, {\"lat\": 38.9636703, \"lng\": -77.0822945}, {\"lat\": 38.9632166, \"lng\": -77.0828749}, {\"lat\": 38.9626386, \"lng\": -77.0836144}, {\"lat\": 38.9565774, \"lng\": -77.0913681}, {\"lat\": 38.9489992, \"lng\": -77.1010614}, {\"lat\": 38.9404011, \"lng\": -77.112058}, {\"lat\": 38.9343511, \"lng\": -77.1197949}]','Most Efficient Remodeling in DC area','With hundreds of projects completed, we have developed a unique project management system that ensures that your project is finished as soon as it is possible. Basementremodeling.com has multiple locations scattered all over the DMV area to ensure fast delivery of materials and quick turn around times. Our <b>average basement remodel takes only 2 months</b>, so you could have your new basement in a matter of weeks! Don\'t wait, and get a free online quote now to get an idea of the pricing.','Basement Renovations to Inspire You!','Deciding where to start with your basement remodel can be challenging. After all there are so many choices to make: the best flooring, the right wall colors, the cabinets that will match your kitchen design ... It can be a lot! <br><br>\r\nWe are here to help. Basementremodeling.com has put together a collection of basement ideas our previous clients loved for you to go through and decide which styles you like best! All of these concepts are attainable with us as your basement remodeling contractor.',0,9,'Why We Are The Best Choice For Your Basement Finishing Project ','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v1_promo_compressed.mp4'),(33,'basement-finishing-area/md/baltimore/white-marsh','Professional Basement Finishing in White Marsh, Maryland ','Top-quality work from experienced professionals ready to serve you in all your basement remodeling needs. Serving Baltimore County for 15 years.','basement, finishing, remodeling, white marsh, maryland, md, baltimore, county, contractor, company, licensed, insured, certified, affordable, top-rated, experienced, egress windows, walkouts, custom engineering, family room, bathroom, bedroom, gym, home theater, double doors, HVAC, 3d designs, 3d models','Award-Winning Quality Basement finishing and renovation in White Marsh, MD','<p>Experienced and licensed <strong>finished basement company</strong> ready to help with all your basement remodeling projects</p>','900+ Completed Basement Renovations ','Browse through our portfolio to explore our <b>beautiful finished basements</b> in our 15-year history as a basement remodel company. Your basement could be next!','BasementRemodeling.com was featured on House Smarts, which was aired on CNBC back in September of 2019. This basement is located in Potomac, MD, and was completed by BasementRemodeling.com (ex- Basement Masters) during the Spring of 2019 for Mr. and Mrs. Terlinsky. Our whole team thanks Alan and Joan for the opportunity to transform their dream of a smart basement into a reality.','The overwhelmingly positive reception from our clients makes Basement Remodeling Company stand out from other basement remodeling companies in Maryland. It definitely means something to us, and we think it should mean something to you, too!','Want to know what our past clients have to say about their basement remodeling experiences with Basement Remodeling Company?','We love our clients and they love us!','Licenses and Insurance','BasementRemodeling.com is a fully licensed and insured basement contractor in Maryland, Washington DC and Virginia. Our Virginia Class A Contractor License (VA Class A) number is 2705159425, our Maryland Home Improvement Commission License (MHIC) number is 129172 and our DC Class A Contractor License (DC Class A) number is 410516000631. We have posted copies of our basement remodeling licenses and insurance certificates below. Please note: any basement finishing or remodeling project requires a separate set of permits which should be pulled by a licensed contractor/electrician/plumber etc. You can easily check any contractors license here:','Follow us on Instagram','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/33/f3c1405ec2d63d2214550d466e1254c7','Top-rated Basement Renovation company in the White Marsh, Maryland Area','<p>Basementremodeling.com is a local, family-owned <strong>finished basement company</strong> established in 2006. Since then we have had the absolute pleasure of remodeling over 900 projects in and around Baltimore County. We pride ourselves on our professional and highly organized staff, who are more than ready to turn that drab old basement into a wonderful addition to your home. We specialize in waterproofing, so there will never be a need to worry about mold or a flooded basement. Our <strong>basement renovation company</strong> is also well trained to install HVAC systems to keep your house nice and comfortable.</p>\r\n<p>Click the button below to learn more about why we\'re the <strong>basement contractor</strong> you should use on your next project!</p>','39.3794196','-76.45990429999999','10','2020-10-27 16:29:14','[{\"lat\": 39.3759715, \"lng\": -76.5014106}, {\"lat\": 39.3760735, \"lng\": -76.5009875}, {\"lat\": 39.3761062, \"lng\": -76.5008302}, {\"lat\": 39.376451, \"lng\": -76.4992197}, {\"lat\": 39.3767561, \"lng\": -76.4978572}, {\"lat\": 39.3768673, \"lng\": -76.4973273}, {\"lat\": 39.3770433, \"lng\": -76.4965121}, {\"lat\": 39.3771045, \"lng\": -76.4962197}, {\"lat\": 39.376806, \"lng\": -76.496132}, {\"lat\": 39.375847, \"lng\": -76.4958759}, {\"lat\": 39.3756162, \"lng\": -76.4958134}, {\"lat\": 39.3754797, \"lng\": -76.4957732}, {\"lat\": 39.3754003, \"l