y!\r\n',0,5,'We\'ll make your basement look beautiful','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v1_promo_compressed.mp4'),(37,'basement-finishing-area/md/prince-george/bowie','Basement Remodeling and Finishing in Bowie, MD','We are a local, family-owned basement finishing company with 15 years of experience in Bowie, Maryland. Schedule your free in-home consultation today!','','Basement Remodeling and Finishing in Bowie, MD','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">BasementRemodeling.com has come to Bowie, Maryland, to provide <strong>incomparable basement finishing, remodeling, and renovation services</strong>. Our local, family-owned company is your one-way ticket to the basement of your dreams.</span></p>','900+ Basement Projects Successfully Completed','BasementRemodling.com has compiled a rich portfolio of over 15 years of projects that you should check out. Having remodeled and <b>finished of over 900+ basements</b>, we consider ourselves experts in our field! Browse through our projects and remember, your basement could be next.','','','','','','','','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/37/PG_County,_Bowie','Basement Remodeling and Finishing Services in Bowie, MD','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">We are the <strong>finished basement company with 15+ years of experience</strong> in basement finishing. Our professional team of designers, carpenters and project managers guarantee unparallel experience, and our reviews on sites such as HomeAdvisor, Angie\'s List, Yelp, and more are a testament to their dedication. Our basement renovation services have been appreciated by hundreds: you could be next! We will handle every single aspect of your project: from permits to final touches.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">You can schedule a free in-home consultation today to get started on your basement remodeling and finishing journey.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> Or, click the button below to learn more.</span></span></p>','38.89511','-77.03637','8','2021-09-09 20:36:54','[{\"lat\": 38.9940161, \"lng\": -76.7998736}, {\"lat\": 38.9924824, \"lng\": -76.7991907}, {\"lat\": 38.9910455, \"lng\": -76.7983812}, {\"lat\": 38.9883355, \"lng\": -76.7968749}, {\"lat\": 38.9889441, \"lng\": -76.7897877}, {\"lat\": 38.9880145, \"lng\": -76.7896367}, {\"lat\": 38.9880494, \"lng\": -76.7892014}, {\"lat\": 38.9876799, \"lng\": -76.7891338}, {\"lat\": 38.987639, \"lng\": -76.789592}, {\"lat\": 38.986733, \"lng\": -76.7894343}, {\"lat\": 38.9867913, \"lng\": -76.7887165}, {\"lat\": 38.9854907, \"lng\": -76.7878424}, {\"lat\": 38.9857288, \"lng\": -76.7876584}, {\"lat\": 38.9859072, \"lng\": -76.7874823}, {\"lat\": 38.9861205, \"lng\": -76.7868327}, {\"lat\": 38.9862742, \"lng\": -76.7861299}, {\"lat\": 38.9864994, \"lng\": -76.7855032}, {\"lat\": 38.9871703, \"lng\": -76.7841879}, {\"lat\": 38.9873738, \"lng\": -76.7839269}, {\"lat\": 38.9891532, \"lng\": -76.7834337}, {\"lat\": 38.9897616, \"lng\": -76.783806}, {\"lat\": 38.9897705, \"lng\": -76.7837945}, {\"lat\": 38.9910756, \"lng\": -76.7838822}, {\"lat\": 38.9910756, \"lng\": -76.7838745}, {\"lat\": 38.9915106, \"lng\": -76.7839037}, {\"lat\": 38.9916092, \"lng\": -76.7826801}, {\"lat\": 38.9920508, \"lng\": -76.7827459}, {\"lat\": 38.9927153, \"lng\": -76.782854}, {\"lat\": 38.9934976, \"lng\": -76.7838061}, {\"lat\": 38.993795, \"lng\": -76.7838382}, {\"lat\": 38.9943857, \"lng\": -76.783902}, {\"lat\": 38.9943916, \"lng\": -76.7839026}, {\"lat\": 38.9946414, \"lng\": -76.7804659}, {\"lat\": 38.9958243, \"lng\": -76.7806048}, {\"lat\": 38.9963383, \"lng\": -76.7780531}, {\"lat\": 38.9965301, \"lng\": -76.7786328}, {\"lat\": 38.9970021, \"lng\": -76.7793033}, {\"lat\": 38.9974061, \"lng\": -76.7796643}, {\"lat\": 38.9984872, \"lng\": -76.7800623}, {\"lat\": 38.9987017, \"lng\": -76.7800693}, {\"lat\": 38.997213, \"lng\": -76.7774013}, {\"lat\": 38.9974653, \"lng\": -76.7775388}, {\"lat\": 38.9982771, \"lng\": -76.7730409}, 