hs</b>, and getting an online quote to start that journey only takes 60 seconds!  ','Begin Brainstorming','Do you need any ideas or want to know what\'s possible for BasementRemodleing.com to achieve? Say less because BasementRemodleing.com presents a wide array of basement ideas that include projects of our own and projects we can bring to life in your space!<br><br>\r\n Whether you\'re thinking of <b>transforming your basement</b> into a guest bedroom, a game room for the kids, a mini bar room, an in-house gym, a cinema or a family room, BasementRemodleing.com can make it happen. Long gone are the days when basements could only be used as storage spaces and were considered the creepy underbelly of a haunted house. Start brainstorming with these basement ideas and choose what you want your basement to become!',0,2,'This Is Why You Should Choose Us For Your Basement Renovation','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v2_promo_compressed.mp4'),(38,'basement-finishing-area/md/prince-george/upper-marlboro','Basement Remodeling and Finishing in Upper Marlboro','For over 15 years, we have delivered the best basements in the DMV region as a local, family-owned business. It\'s simple to get started; get an online quote now!','','Basement Remodeling and Finishing in Upper Marlboro, MD','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">For over 15 years, we have delivered the best basements in the Upper Marlboro, Maryland region as a local, family-owned business. It\'s simple to get started; get an online quotate now!</span></p>','Our job is to assist you in upgrading your home!','Please take a look at the <b>basement remodels</b> we\'ve done in the past! We have amassed a sizable portfolio over a decade in business. Get inspired by the numerous inventive basement renovations that have been accomplished and showcased in our gallery. A wet bar, a child\'s playroom, an extra bathroom, an office, or your gym are only some of the options!','','','','','','','','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/38/Upper_Marlboro_City','Basement Remodeling Company That Will Not Dissapoint','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">We are proud to be a family-owned firm that has received <a href=\"../../../about-us/reviews/\">several accolades</a> from recognized organizations. When we complete a project, customer happiness is at the top of our priority list. Being top-rated or highlighted on CNBC isn\'t enough. We will assist you in any way because we want you to have the <strong>finest basement remodeling experience</strong> possible.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Schedule your free in-home consultation with us now if you\'re ready to get started on your basement project! Otherwise, click the icon below to learn more about how we work.</span></p>','38.89511','-77.03637','8','2021-09-09 20:38:53','[{\"lat\": 38.817653, \"lng\": -76.7639914}, {\"lat\": 38.8119477, \"lng\": -76.760324}, {\"lat\": 38.8121652, \"lng\": -76.7597639}, {\"lat\": 38.8119938, \"lng\": -76.7596188}, {\"lat\": 38.8119892, \"lng\": -76.7596257}, {\"lat\": 38.811976, \"lng\": -76.7596037}, {\"lat\": 38.8118695, \"lng\": -76.7595136}, {\"lat\": 38.8120438, \"lng\": -76.7591914}, {\"lat\": 38.812142, \"lng\": -76.7590933}, {\"lat\": 38.8122069, \"lng\": -76.7587715}, {\"lat\": 38.8123048, \"lng\": -76.7585338}, {\"lat\": 38.8124358, \"lng\": -76.7584075}, {\"lat\": 38.8124792, \"lng\": -76.7582674}, {\"lat\": 38.8126537, \"lng\": -76.7580014}, {\"lat\": 38.8128283, \"lng\": -76.7578749}, {\"lat\": 38.8128825, \"lng\": -76.7576514}, {\"lat\": 38.812945, \"lng\": -76.7575508}, {\"lat\": 38.8130897, \"lng\": -76.7573572}, {\"lat\": 38.8131976, \"lng\": -76.7572938}, {\"lat\": 38.8132263, \"lng\": -76.7572261}, {\"lat\": 38.8133049, \"lng\": -76.7569848}, {\"lat\": 38.8133742, \"lng\": -76.7568512}, {\"lat\": 38.813427, \"lng\": -76.7567231}, {\"lat\": 38.8134819, \"lng\": -76.7565725}, {\"lat\": 38.8135076, \"lng\": -76.7564896}, {\"lat\": 38.8