oncept that strikes out you. Basements may be designed in various designs, so let\'s choose one that works for you and bring it to life together!<br><br>\r\nChoosing to remodel your basement is a great way to increase the value of your house and create a useable space. <br><br>\r\nWe will make it easy to remodel your basement and walk you through each process stage, from preparing the area for the building to putting the final touches.',0,2,'We\'re More Than Just A Contractor','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v2_promo_compressed.mp4'),(39,'basement-finishing-area/md/anne-arundel/severna-park','Licensed Basement Remodeling and Finishing in Severna Park, MD','Our local basement remodeling company is a prestigious brand that will ensure your basement renovations plans are completed without complications. Schedule your free in-home consultation today!','','Highly rated Basement Remodel Company in Severan Park, Maryland','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We are a local, family-owned business dedicated to delivering the best basements in the DMV area for over 15 years. Getting started is easy - get your online quote today!</span></p>','Our Job Is To Help Upgrade Your Home!','Explore the <b>renovated basements</b> that we have completed in the past! We have a massive portfolio from over a decade of being in business. Get inspired with the many creative <b>basement renovations</b> completed and shared in our portfolio. Some possibilities include a wet bar, a child’s playroom, an extra bathroom, office, or your own personal gym for your convenience. And many more options!','','','','','','','','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/39/8d60376035d7cd4a1fd6ec04cee48ecf','Our Basement Remodeling Company Will Not Let You Down','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We take pride in being a family-owned business and with many awards from reputable sources. Customer satisfaction is at the top of our priority list when doing a job. It isn&rsquo;t enough to be top-rated or featured on CNBC. We will help in every way imaginable because we want you to have the best <strong>basement renovation</strong> experience possible. </span></p>\r\n<p>If you are ready to get started with your <strong>basement remodel</strong>, schedule your free in-home consultation with us today! Otherwise, hit the button below to learn more about our process.&nbsp;</p>','39.07089637696009','-76.54657192075328','9','2021-09-09 20:40:32','[{\"lat\": 39.1115396, \"lng\": -76.6310579}, {\"lat\": 39.111239, \"lng\": -76.6309563}, {\"lat\": 39.1107327, \"lng\": -76.6307697}, {\"lat\": 39.1104629, \"lng\": -76.6306518}, {\"lat\": 39.1102195, \"lng\": -76.6305378}, {\"lat\": 39.1099726, \"lng\": -76.6304163}, {\"lat\": 39.1099665, \"lng\": -76.630413}, {\"lat\": 39.1096035, \"lng\": -76.630216}, {\"lat\": 39.107786, \"lng\": -76.6291458}, {\"lat\": 39.1072966, \"lng\": -76.6288747}, {\"lat\": 39.1068607, \"lng\": -76.6286521}, {\"lat\": 39.1064545, \"lng\": -76.6284597}, {\"lat\": 39.1060759, \"lng\": -76.6283}, {\"lat\": 39.1057575, \"lng\": -76.6281704}, {\"lat\": 39.1054158, \"lng\": -76.6280429}, {\"lat\": 39.1049866, \"lng\": -76.6278937}, {\"lat\": 39.1039678, \"lng\": -76.6275898}, {\"lat\": 39.1031733, \"lng\": -76.6273105}, {\"lat\": 39.1028067, \"lng\": -76.627222}, {\"lat\": 39.1025017, \"lng\": -76.6271566}, {\"lat\": 39.1022142, \"lng\": -76.6271008}, {\"lat\": 39.1019275, \"lng\": -76.6270529}, {\"lat\": 39.1017661, \"lng\": -76.6270288}, {\"lat\": 39.1013901, \"lng\": -76.6269879}, {\"lat\": 39.1011393, \"lng\": -76.6269677}, {\"lat\": 39.100709, \"lng\": -76.6269368}, {\"lat\": 39.1003199, \"lng\": -76.6269053}, {\"lat\": 39.0999808, \"lng\": -76.6268585}, {\"lat\": 39.0998523, \"lng\": -76.6268335}, {\"lat\": 39.0996306, \"lng\": -76.6267904}, {\"lat\": 39.0995805, \"lng\": -76.6267734}, {\"lat\": 39.0993214, \"lng\": -76.6267066}, {\"lat\": 39.0989976, \"lng\": -76.6266067}, {\"lat\": 39.0987882, \"lng\": -7