at\": 38.7332484, \"lng\": -77.5265024}]','Finished Basement Company In Manassas, VA','We have established 10 locations scattered all over the DMV area that ensure prompt services with the avoidance of delays and setbacks. This makes BasementRemodeling.com’s projects time-efficient, with the <b>average basement projects taking only 2 months</b> to complete from start to finish. You can begin your journey of basement remodeling, finishing or renovation by getting an online quote to get an idea of pricing in less than a minute!','Get Inspired!','Can\'t pick between turning your basement into a convenient storage space or turning it into a spare bedroom? No worries, BasementRemodeling.com has put together a wide array of basement ideas for you to browse through that include projects we have completed! <br><br>\r\nThe collection includes the various ways and options you can use to turn your basement into anything from an indoor pool, music room or gym to a family room, at-home cinema, kids playroom, and so much more!',0,8,' Remodel your basement with the experts','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v3_promo_compressed.mp4'),(47,'basement-finishing-area/md/montgomery/','Basement Remodeling Company in Montgomery County Maryland','Begin your basement finishing project now with the best basement contractor in Maryland! BasementRemodeling.com is a well-known basement remodeling firm that has served residents of Montgomery County, Maryland for 15+ years. ','','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Montgomery County, Maryland','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">Begin your basement finishing project now with the <strong>best basement contractor</strong> in Maryland! BasementRemodeling.com is a well-known basement remodeling firm that has served residents of Montgomery County, Maryland for 15+ years.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>','Quality Portfolio, Quality Relationships','Our team has a passion for transforming your ideas into beautiful and creative basement spaces. More importantly, our team will work with you to both plan for and achieve your goals. Trusted in the industry for our professionalism and dedication to great customer service, our portfolio boasts hundreds of clients right here in Montgomery County who are incredibly pleased with their <b>finished basements</b>. \r\n\r\n','','','','','','','','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/47/58d717e191ca1bc96f8104d769c4e9f2','Basement Finishing in Montgomery County','<p>Basementremodeling.com was founded in Montgomery County, and we do our best to provide the best quality <strong>basement finishing services</strong> to our first county. Getting started is very easy: begin by getting a free online quote to get an idea of the pricing for your upcoming basement remodel. Then, if you are ready, schedule a free in-home consultation with our project consultants to talk about your ideal basement. We will take care of all the permits/inspections/etc. from there!</p>\r\n<p>For a more specific overview of our process, hit the button below!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you are lookin for information on more specific locations, here is a selection of cities we had served in the past: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/montgomery/bethesda\">Bethesda</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/montgomery/gaithersburg\">Gaithersburg</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/montgomery/germantown\">Germantown</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/montgomery/olney\">Olney</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/montgomery/potomac\">Potomac</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/montgomery/silver-spring\">Silver Spring</a>, and <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/montgomery/rockville\">Rockville</a>.&nbsp;</p>','38.89511','-77.03637','8','2021-09-29 18:58:31','[{\"lat\": 39.1461112, \"lng\": -77.527376}, {\"lat\": 39.1433989, \"lng\": -77.527312}, {\"lat\": 3