lace, where to put a TV, how to elevate a bathroom, or how to make a basement feel open and bigger.\r\nHow about including a laundry room, or knocking down walls, or adding new built-in storage options to make more use of your space?\r\nNo matter the size, layout, or budget, we will help you get the most our of your basement. ',0,5,'We Are the Most Trustworthy Contractor For Basement Finishing','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v1_promo_compressed.mp4'),(54,'basement-finishing-area/va/fairfaxcounty/','Basement Finishing in Fairfax County, Virginia','','','Basement Finishing in Fairfax County, Virginia','<p>Basement Finishing in Fairfax County, Virginia</p>','Basement Finishing in Fairfax County, Virginia','Basement Finishing in Fairfax County, Virginia','','','','','','','',NULL,'Basement Finishing in Fairfax County, Virginia','<p>Basement Finishing in Fairfax County, Virginia</p>','38.89511','-77.03637','8','2021-09-29 20:20:08','[{\"lat\": 38.842666, \"lng\": -77.5370408}, {\"lat\": 38.8426421, \"lng\": -77.5370394}, {\"lat\": 38.8423108, \"lng\": -77.5370194}, {\"lat\": 38.8421144, \"lng\": -77.5369335}, {\"lat\": 38.8411325, \"lng\": -77.5364293}, {\"lat\": 38.8407607, \"lng\": -77.5362845}, {\"lat\": 38.8406688, \"lng\": -77.5361396}, {\"lat\": 38.8404766, \"lng\": -77.5359036}, {\"lat\": 38.8403721, \"lng\": -77.5357909}, {\"lat\": 38.8400274, \"lng\": -77.5355463}, {\"lat\": 38.839503, \"lng\": -77.5350721}, {\"lat\": 38.8393066, \"lng\": -77.5348575}, {\"lat\": 38.8392105, \"lng\": -77.5346537}, {\"lat\": 38.8391729, \"lng\": -77.5343962}, {\"lat\": 38.8391604, \"lng\": -77.5341548}, {\"lat\": 38.839081, \"lng\": -77.5336934}, {\"lat\": 38.8390016, \"lng\": -77.5333769}, {\"lat\": 38.838801, \"lng\": -77.5327976}, {\"lat\": 38.8385629, \"lng\": -77.532288}, {\"lat\": 38.8381492, \"lng\": -77.5316228}, {\"lat\": 38.8375224, \"lng\": -77.5305553}, {\"lat\": 38.837372, \"lng\": -77.5303568}, {\"lat\": 38.8372216, \"lng\": -77.