,'If you have an unfinished basement in your house, there may be a better way to use that space. A finished basement is a popular home improvement project among homeowners, and it has the potential to attract more purchasers to your home in the future. <br><br>\r\nAre you looking for a home office or a place to organize your belongings? What about a special hobbies room? If you enjoy music, you might be thinking of setting up an at-home studio. Perhaps you\'d like an at-home fitness facility to remove the need to commute to the gym eventually! <br><br>\r\nOur basement finishing firm can handle anything, and we will collaborate with you to ensure that your vision is accomplished.',0,6,'We Will Transform Your Unfinished Basement Into A Place You\'ll Love!','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v1_promo_compressed.mp4'),(59,'basement-finishing-area/md/baltimore/','Basement Finishing in Baltimore, Maryland','Achieve your basement remodel dreams with our family-owned and professional company serving Maryland since 2006. Visit our website and get a free quote today!','','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Baltimore, Maryland','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">We are the most trusted local and family-owned <strong>basement finishing contractor</strong> in Maryland. With&nbsp; 15+ years in the industry and 900+ finished projects, we can guarantee amazing results and quick execution.</span></p>','Basement remodels we are proud of','Over 15+ years of experience in basement finishing, we have built a large portfolio of projects. We are happy to showcase them to you as a testament of our dedication and expertise. ','','','','','','','','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/59/Baltimore_County','Basement Finishing in Baltimore, Maryland','<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">We, at BasementRemodeling.com, have a significant portfolio of projects from our 15+ years of basement finishing experience and 900+ finishing projects.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">We are pleased to present these to you as evidence of our devotion and skill. You may change the layout of your basement to create a bespoke area with the particular fit and function your household requires. With us as <strong>your basement finishing contractor</strong>, you will not have to worry about a thing - we\'ll ensure all the permits are in place and all inspections go smoothly. All you need is to wait an see how your basement comes to life!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">To get started, schedule a free in-home consultation to have a project consultant visit your home in to look over your basement and walk you through the next steps.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">If you are looking for information on specific locaitons in Baltimore County, here are the selected cities we had pleasure to serve in the past: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/baltimore/cockeysville\">Cockeysville</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/baltimore/owings-mills\">Owings-Mills</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/baltimore/white-marsh\">White-Marsh</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/baltimore/hampton\">Hampton</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/baltimore/towson\">Towson</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/baltimore/timonium\">Lutherville-Timonium</a>.</span></p>','38.89511','-77.03637','8','2021-09-29 20:37:13','[{\"lat\": 39.4278324, \"lng\": -76.8965564}, {\"lat\": 39.4271883, \"lng\": -76.8964973}, {\"lat\": 39.4265086, \"lng\": -76.8963645}, {\"lat\": 39.4262009, \"lng\": -76.8961155}, {\"lat\": 39.4261239, \"lng\": -76.8958166}, {\"lat\": 39.4262522, \"lng\": -76.8952854}, {\"lat\": 39.4266625, \"lng\": -76.8946047}, {\"lat\": 39.4270087, \"lng\": -76.8940071}, {\"lat\": 39.4274447, \"lng\": -76.8933762}, {\"lat\": 39.4278679, \"lng\": -76.893011}, {\"lat\": 39.42