 playroom! You can also make it more mature and turn it into your home office, or even an in-house gym. There\'s a world of possibilities, and our <b>high-end basement remodeling company</b> can help you reach them.',0,5,'The Best Contractor For Your Basement Project','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v1_promo_compressed.mp4');
INSERT INTO `landings` VALUES (60,'basement-finishing-area/md/','Award-Winning Finished Basement Company In Maryland','Our Award-winning Basement Remodeling Company will help you maximize the potential of your space and add timeless value, get a free quote today. ','','Maryland’s Award-Winning Basement Remodeling Experts','<p>With over 15 years in the business of <strong>basement finishing</strong>, we know a thing or two about great quality, reliable service, and exceptional value in the <strong>Maryland</strong> area!</p>','Over 900 Basements Finished (& Counting!)','It’s time to maximize the potential of your home and transform that dingy basement into a space the whole family can enjoy. See why the folks here in <b>Maryland</b> pick us as the <b>basement finishing contractor</b> of their choice. Use the “View Portfolio” button to click through a collection of hundreds of our finished projects, with many right here in the Maryland area. Whether you are looking for inspiration for a basement home theater, home office, guest bedroom, or personal gym, our Portfolio will get you thinking about the endless possibilities for your new space!','','','','','','','','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/60/e8f5f6db99a4dbf8d6bd1a003b2cbb2b','Top-Rated Basement Renovation Near You','<p>Our happy clients have been gracious enough to provide their honest opinions of our work and we are pleased to feature them on our website. If you&rsquo;re still wondering why you should choose our <strong>basement finishing company</strong>, let us highlight the important stuff:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Efficiency - Locally situated warehouses means speedy service for our customers. Prior to your project, we can determine an effective timeline for your project and stick to it!</li>\r\n<li>Availability - We love working with our customers. Our team is always just a quick phone call or email away for any and all questions you may have throughout the process.</li>\r\n<li>Professionalism - We pride ourselves on our reputation for award-winning <strong>basement remodeling services</strong> and transparency in the industry. All of our pertinent insurance documentation and certification is viewable on our website.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Looking for a more specific location? You can find the counties we service in Maryland below:<br /><br /><a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/montgomery\">Montgomery County</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/howard\">Howard County</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/baltimore/\">Baltimore County</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/prince-george/\">Prince George\'s County</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/anne-arundel/\">Anne Arundel County</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/frederick/\">Frederick County</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/carroll/\">Carroll County</a>, <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/hartford/\">Harford County</a>, and <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/charles/\">Charle\'s County</a></p>','38.89511','-77.03637','7','2021-09-30 19:16:42','[{\"lat\": 39.2652307, \"lng\": -79.4873055}, {\"lat\": 39.2648835, \"lng\": -79.4859554}, {\"lat\": 39.2550342, \"lng\": -79.4861307}, {\"lat\": 39.2367401, \"lng\": -79.4864586}, {\"lat\": 39.2363712, \"lng\": -79.4864652}, {\"lat\": 39.2113043, \"lng\": -79.4869141}, {\"lat\": 39.2091932, \"lng\": -79.4869503}, {\"lat\": 39.2058766, \"lng\": -79.4870169}, {\"lat\": 39.2057075, \"lng\": -79.4861367}, {\"lat\": 39.2056818, \"lng\": -79.4855229}, {\"lat\": 39.2057589, \"lng\": -79.4849921}, {\"lat\": 39.2056689, \"lng\": -79.4841461}, {\"lat\": 39.2054504, \"lng\": -79.4839138}, {\"lat\": 39.2055018, \"lng\": -79.4834991}, {\"lat\": 39.2056047, \"lng\": -79.4831673}, {\"lat\": 39.2055275, \"lng\": -79.4830346}, {\"lat\": 39.2051805, \"lng\": -79.4830014}, {\"lat\": 39.2050776, \"lng\": -79.4826365}, {\"lat\": 39.2050648, \"lng