your basement remodeling ideas will cost in Virginia.','Basement Remodeling Ideas That Are Personal To You','When it comes to your new basement renovation project, the sky is the limit. With elaborate floor patterns or wall treatments that make you feel at ease, you may let your personality come through. <br><br>\r\nYou may put your unique touch to any space, whether it\'s a basement bar or a gym to exercise in after work.<br><br>\r\nYou can install railings for easier access or protect your basement in case of floods with waterproofing; the choice is entirely yours. \r\nWith a qualified and experienced crew on your side, you can transform your empty basement into practically whatever your mind can conjure up. <br><br>\r\nThese creative basement remodeling ideas can get you started on the right track.',0,7,'The Best Contractor For Your Basement Project','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v2_promo_compressed.mp4'),(63,'basement-finishing-area/md/charles/','Basement Remodeling Company in Charles County, Maryland','Our Family-Owned Basement Remodeling Company in Charles County, MD will make your basement remodeling projects become a reality. 15+ years of experience. ','','Licensed Basement Renovation Services in Charles County, MD','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Start your <strong>basement remodeling project</strong> with the number one <strong>basement contractor</strong> in the DMV area today !</span></p>','Review Our Completed Basement Designs for Inspiration!','<b>Redoing a basement</b> can be challenging for some, but not for us.  Explore some of the works we are most proud of and think what your remodeled basement could look like. ','','','','','','','','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/63/68850bbca0a2616e96d6391966f4f984','A Basement Finishing Company That Will Leave You Satisfied ','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our <strong>basement remodel company</strong> is determined to promptly finish your basement with ease and minimal disturbance to your lifestyle. Our team holds themselves accountable for any and all jobs that we have received. After we are done with the </span><strong>basement finishing</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong> process</strong>, we want you to walk in excited to see a newly renovated space curated to your wants and needs. With years of experience on our belt, we aim to maintain a consistent reputation with all clients. We hold our company to the highest standards and hope to see you join our family today.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you are ready to get started with your basement remodel, schedule your free in-home consultation today!</span></p>','38.89511','-77.03637','8','2021-11-16 18:11:50','[{\"lat\": 38.4337242, \"lng\": -77.3235261}, {\"lat\": 38.4334644, \"lng\": -77.3234512}, {\"lat\": 38.4332031, \"lng\": -77.3233759}, {\"lat\": 38.432993, \"lng\": -77.3232579}, {\"lat\": 38.4327195, \"lng\": -77.323266}, {\"lat\": 38.4324888, \"lng\": -77.3232579}, {\"lat\": 38.4322703, \"lng\": -77.3233116}, {\"lat\": 38.4319005, \"lng\": -77.3232579}, {\"lat\": 38.4316315, \"lng\": -77.3231828}, {\"lat\": 38.4313984, \"lng\": -77.3230552}, {\"lat\": 38.4313073, \"lng\": -77.3230053}, {\"lat\": 38.4312151, \"lng\": -77.3229548}, {\"lat\": 38.4311142, \"lng\": -77.3230192}, {\"lat\": 38.4309508, \"lng\": -77.3229897}, {\"lat\": 38.4302196, \"lng\": -77.3225605}, {\"lat\": 38.4297443, \"lng\": -77.3224828}, {\"lat\": 38.4297405, \"lng\": -77.3223245}, {\"lat\": 38.4289925, \"lng\": -77.3219597}, {\"lat\": 38.4280007, \"lng\": -77.3217237}, {\"lat\": 38.4277523, \"lng\": -77.3214635}, {\"lat\": 38.4275805, \"lng\": -77.3213375}, {\"lat\": 38.4274628, \"lng\": -77.3212838}, {\"lat\": 38.4273367, \"lng\": -77.3213482}, {\"lat\": 38.4270884, \"lng\": -77.3211953}, {\"lat\": 38.4270173, \"lng\": -77.3212838}, {\"lat\": 38.4268913, \"lng\": -77.3212731}, {\"lat\": 38.426853, \"lng\": -77.3211738}, {\"