Clients Loved!','<b>Remodeling the basement</b> can leave you flustered; from the color, to the floorplans, it can get overwhelming. That is where we come in! After completing jobs all over the DMV area, basementremodeling.com can get you any <b>basement design</b> you desire or help you find one that is perfect for you. As <b>your finished basement company</b>, we can recreate one of those ideas or help you come up with your own. Remodeling basements is serious business and needs to be planned accordingly -- rest assured we can help you create the perfect basement. ',NULL,2,'How We Can Create Your Perfect Basement','','https://basementremodeling-archive-12345.s3.amazonaws.com/statis/v1_promo_compressed.mp4'),(65,'basement-finishing-area/va/fairfax/annandale','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Annandale, VA','Looking for a top-rated basement remodeling and finishing expert in Annandale, VA? With over 15 years of experience, BasementRemodeling.com is your trusted local basement finishing company!','basement, finishing, remodeling, annandale, virginia, va, contractor, company, licensed, insured, certified, affordable, top-rated, experienced, egress windows, walkouts, custom engineering, family room, bathroom, bedroom, gym, home theater, double doors, HVAC, 3d designs, 3d models','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Annandale, VA','<p><span class=\"s1\">As Virginia\'s leading basement remodeling experts, we bring over 15 years of experience and a track record of 900+ successfully completed projects. Trust us to transform your basement!!</span></p>','Our Basement Remodeling Portfolio','With over 15 years as Annandale, VA\'s top basement finishing contractor, we\'ve crafted a stunning portfolio of completed projects. Explore our work to see the possibilities for your basement transformation!','','','','','','','','https://basementremodeling.com/public/upload/landings/65/Ananndale-contractor','Schedule Your Consultation with BasementRemodeling.com Now For Basement Finishing in Annandale, VA!','<p>Do you remember that unused room downstairs, filled with old clothes, tools, and toys? Imagine if BasementRemodeling.com transformed it into a stylish workplace, a cozy home theater, or an exciting game room. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Whether your project is big or small, our local, family-owned basement renovation company, with a history of serving the community, is here to help. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Schedule a free in-home consultation today, and one of our representatives will visit to discuss your ideas and vision for the basement redesign. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>After your consultation, you&rsquo;ll have a clear understanding of what to expect from the transformation of your basement into a brand-new space in Annandale, VA. &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Rest assured, you&rsquo;ll stay informed every step of the way, and we&rsquo;ll treat your basement finishing project with the same care and dedication as if it were our own home.</p>','38.82624644250125','-77.20194929475097','14','2024-11-04 19:48:52',NULL,'Making Basement Remodeling Simple in Virginia','Our focus on timely execution and dependability is why we maintain multiple locations across Virginia, Washington, DC, and Maryland.<br><br>\r\nThis allows our crew to quickly access a warehouse near your home. You\'ll collaborate directly with our team, who will keep you informed every step of the way during your basement transformation. When you choose us as <b>your basement contractor</b>, you can expect a clear strategy, seamless construction, and full project management.<br><br>\r\nContact us today for a free estimate and find out how much your basement renovation ideas in Virginia will cost!','Custom Basement Remodeling Concepts Designed Just for You','The sky is the limit when it comes to your <b>new basement renovation project</b>. You may let your personality shine through with creative floor patterns or wall treatments that make you feel at ease.<br><br>\r\nYou may add your personal touch to any place, whether it\'s a <b>basement bar</b> or a gym for after-work training.<br><br>\r\nYou can build rails for better access or waterproof your basement to protect it from flooding; the choice is completely yours.<br><br>\r\nWith a competent and experienced staff on your side, you can turn your empty basement into anything your imagination can think up.<br><br>\r\nOur imaginative basement renovation ideas below can get you started in the right direction.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(66,'basement-finishing-area/va/fairfax/burke/','Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Burke, VA','Explore top-quality basement remodeling and finishing services in Burke, VA. Transform your space with trusted experts who specialize in creating functional and stylish basements tailored to your needs.','basement, finishing, remodeling, bel air, maryland, md, harford, county, contractor, company, licensed, insured, certified, affordable, top-rated, experienced, egress windows, walkouts, custom engineering, family room, bathroom, bedroom, gym, home theater, double doors, HVAC, 3d designs, 3d models','Basement Finishing and Remodeling Services in Burke, VA','<p>Transform your basement with Burke, VA&rsquo;s leading remodeling experts. With over 15 years of experience, we deliver customized solutions to fit your style and needs. Request your free estimate today!</p>','Showcasing Burke, VA’s Stunning Basement Transformations','Discover the possibilities for your basement by exploring our portfolio of completed projects in Burke, VA. From cozy family spaces to sleek home theaters, our work showcases innovative designs and exceptional craftsmanship. Get inspired and see what we can create for your home!','','','','','','','',NULL,'','','38.79858063426501','-77.27379174281486','14','2024-12-06 21:05:18',NULL,'','','','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
