INSERT INTO `portfolio` VALUES (114,'Rockville, MD New Construction','A beautiful new home in Rockville, MD with a uniform look that’s bold and inviting','Rockville MD, Rockville Maryland, Rockville Maryland new homes, LVT flooring, tiled shower, accent wall, laundry room, full bathroom, stair steps ideas','charen-ln-new-construction','Charen Ln New Construction','Potomac, MD','11810 Charen ln, Potomac, MD, 20854','39.0495019','-77.166485',1,6800,342,'<p>A dazzling new home in Rockville, MD with a gently sloping backyard features an amazing sky blue exterior with white trimming, balcony walkway, rowed windows and a spectacular stone accent wall denoting the entrance. Inside, a heavily recessed, darkened door frame with dramatic side windows creates a striking impression against a neutral backdrop of soft grays, LVT flooring and recessed row lighting. The neutral motif extends into the kitchen and dining room (complete with wraparound countertops, cabinets, and a center island), varying only slightly in the living room area by incorporating crisp white-on-white walls, ceiling and trim in contrast to darker LVT flooring. An accent wall with artificial fireplace masterfully draws the eye.</p>\r\n<p>The laundry room has a stacked washer and dryer tucked away neatly across from a stairway with clean white railings and banisters that match the light tones of the LVT flooring. Four bedrooms each have an abundance of natural lighting while maintaining a distinct look and feel through sweeping architectural curves and strategic window placing. The master bathroom has separate toilets, matching extra-wide countertops with twin vanity mirrors and lighted frames, recessed lighting, and a tiled shower with a retractable wand and pull-open glass doors.</p>\r\n<p>Finally, the half-submerged ground floor boasts great acoustics and fun games in the music room, with LVT flooring and neutral gray colors. A giant metallic gray garage with white trimming has enough room for any car collector. Overall, a beautiful new home with a uniform look that&rsquo;s bold and inviting.</p>',1,4,'2020-09-22 15:54:40'),(115,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Springfield, VA','Stunning comprehensive basement remodeling project for a home in Springfield VA by BasementRemodeling.com','Basement finishing and remodeling, Springfield, VA, Springfield VA, basement renovation Springfield VA, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-remodeling-in-springfield-va-20','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Springfield, VA','8290 Swope Ct, Springfield, VA, 22153','38.7546938','-77.2310813',1,1803,377,'<p>At over 1,800 square feet, this basement remodeling project in Springfield VA is practically a full living space on its own! It features a full-size kitchenette and wet bar with marble counters, seating area, sink, cabinets, and even its own kegerator and beverage cooler. The family room has a comfortable seating area with wall-to-wall storage and shelving and an HD TV sits perfectly centered on an accent-tile wall in the middle. In between the wet-bar and the family room, atop lovely LVT flooring, is a pool table for anyone in the mood for a few games. The basement space also includes its own dedicated bathroom, with LVT flooring, shower, and a complimentary color-scheme. If that wasn\'t enough, a cozy home theater tops it all off! The home theater features a custom built media center with elevated seating (eight total seats) in a soft carpeted and closed-off room.</p>',1,24,'2020-09-22 16:05:08'),(116,'Row house Rebuild | BasementRemodeling.com','A hip, modern, and stylishly urban rebuild of a home in Washington DC by BasementRemodeling.com','rebuild, basement contractor, washington dc, portfolio, basement remodeling contractor, basement finishing contractor','1400-block-s-st-nw-rebuild','Row house Rebuild ','Washington, DC','1402 S st nw, Washington, DC','38.9138877','-77.0327769',1,1800,381,'<p>This contemporary Washington DC rowhouse rebuild project is hip, modern and stylishly urban. Wooden stair steps with white spindles and black banisters pop against a trendy accent wall with white baseboard molding and black flooring. A standalone column adds imaginary boundaries and height in the family room, which is further accentuated by tasteful low furniture, big bay windows, and a fireplace with custom mantle. The kitchen-like wet bar makes full use of a stunning corridor space by flanking it with custom cabinets, hidden LED lighting, extra-wide luxury sink, stainless-steel appliances,&nbsp;and under-stairs storage &ndash; topped off with a mini-laundry room in the closet by the glass door entrance.</p>\r\n<p>The second-floor bedroom is replete with full-sized furnishings, muted colors, ample closet space and plenty of light from dual double-hung windows and recessed lighting. An upgraded bathroom features a tiled tub surround, hopper windows, and vanity sink with overhead lighting. A second upgraded bathroom boasts a tiled shower enclosure with glass door, vanity sink,&nbsp;and overhead lighting.</p>',1,6,'2020-09-22 16:14:42'),(117,'Basement Design and Renovation - Full Kitchen and Shelving Built-ins','A delightfully bright custom basement remodeling project in Vienna VA by BasementRemodeling.com','Basement finishing and remodeling Vienna VA, VA, basement renovation Vienna VA, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-in-vienna-va','Basement Design and Renovation - Full Kitchen and Shelving Built-ins','','2526 Flint Hill Rd, Vienna, VA, 22181','38.8934477','-77.2817523',1,1475,403,'<p>This project, designed by BasementRemodeling.com, is for a home in Vienna, VA, and is chock full of aesthetically pleasing features. This sleek and light-focused basement project includes a large family room, custom-built cabinetry, custom media center, kitchen-like wet bar, home theater, gym, full bathroom, and a lot more. Leading to the family room is a kitchen-like wet-bar with a full-size fridge, marble counters, and large dining area. The family room has LVT flooring, large seating area, coffee table, and in-wall cabinetry (meaning it\'s flush with the walls on both sides) with a media center in the middle.</p>\r\n<p>A large sliding barn-style door separates the family room from a spacious home theater. The home theater includes a custom media center with a surround sound system, plenty of comfortable seating space and gray walls for optimal movie watching. A lone decorative column marks the path to a small gym area large enough for two full-size machines and a full-size bathroom with a unique accented-tile design inside the shower. The total basement measures up to 1,475 square feet, offers plenty of fresh designs and space, and never feels too dark!</p>',1,26,'2020-09-22 16:18:00'),(118,'Basement Renovation - Exposed Brick with Hanging Lights','This Basement remodel features unique shelving space underneath the stairs,  decorative column, LVT flooring and a modern home theatre system. Wet bar with marble-themed countertops. Full bathroom includes ceramic mosaic shower pan, a designer mosaic inlay, and a state-of-the-art rain shower system for a truly refreshing experience.','Basement finishing and remodeling Olney MD, basement renovation Olney Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-olney-md-16-03','Basement Renovation - Exposed Brick with Hanging Lights','','Olney, MD 20832','39.1457139','-77.067959',1,1490,423,'<p>An architectural masterpiece, this Olney, Maryland basement remodel project features sweeping angles and other dramatic engineering feats that will add layers of sophistication to any downstairs domain. Unique shelving space is built directly underneath the stairs, and a decorative column adds visual depth to the striking lavender blue bedroom area, which is complete with LVT flooring and a modern home theatre system. A snug kitchen walkway (also LVT) is surrounded by gorgeous jet black floor cabinets, sink, wet bar (with a glass-plated wooden wine rack), and marble-themed countertops that are sure to delight all. The bathroom has been upgraded with an elaborate ceramic mosaic shower pan, a designer mosaic inlay, and a state-of-the-art rain shower system for a truly refreshing experience.</p>\n<p>Feature in: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/montgomery/olney\">Basement Finishing in Olney, Maryland</a></p>',1,42,'2020-09-22 16:21:34'),(119,'Basement Renovation - Upgraded Bathroom and Kids Playroom','Check out this lovely and colorful Columbia, MD basement remodeling and finishing project by BasementRemodeling.com!','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD, basement renovation Columbia Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement remodeling, basement finishing, basement renovation, portfolio, basement design ideas','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-columbia-md-14-11','Basement Renovation - Upgraded Bathroom and Kids Playroom','','10801 Dundee dr, Columbia,MD,21044','39.1987189','-76.88572119999999',1,1125,435,'<p>Your basement should be more than just a storage space, so why not to finish it into an area for the entire family to enjoy? A bright and festive family room &ndash; complete with a separate children&rsquo;s play area &ndash; adds a contemporary touch to your downstairs den; notice the extra-resilient LVT flooring! This basement project features a sleek kitchenette, equipped with modern appliances, and a classic wet bar with accompanying marbled-topped island centerpiece, is perfect for entertaining guests. The fully-upgraded bathroom includes custom-made ceramic wall tiling, a marble mosaic shower pan and an elevated curb. To recap, this is a beautiful family area, kids&rsquo; room, wet bar, kitchenette, and luxury washroom &ndash; all in one basement remodel!</p>',0,51,'2020-09-22 16:24:40'),(120,'Basement Remodeling - Spacious Family Room with Fireplace and Kitchenette','Basement Finishing and Remodeling, Fairfax, VA with a family room, suspended ceiling lights, luxury vinyl tile (LVT), dining area, tiled shower with a deluxe shower pan by Kohler.','Basement finishing and remodeling Fairfax VA, basement renovation Fairfax Virginia, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-fairfax-va-11-11','Basement Remodeling - Spacious Family Room with Fireplace and Kitchenette','','9014 Littleton St Fairfax, VA 22032','38.8367762','-77.257353',1,1250,446,'<p>This extravagant remodeling project begins with a spacious family room outfitted with a white-paneled fireplace and an abundance of plush sitting furniture arranged for cozy, extended conversations.&nbsp; A cream theme with suspended ceiling lights adds a timeless touch that will never go out of style, and makes the area appear larger and more open. The luxury vinyl tile (LVT) flooring expands from the family room into the fully-equipped dining area, which is complete with the most modern stainless steel appliances and a standalone centerpiece island for casual dining. The surrounds shower has been upgraded with immaculate ceramic tiling and a deluxe shower pan by Kohler &ndash; an industry leader you can trust.</p>',1,27,'2020-09-22 16:27:16'),(121,'Basement Remodeling - Home Theater Plus the Gym','A basement remodel in Upper Marlboro, MD gets an updated look that is both masculine and modern. Light-colored LVT flooring and a pale blue color scheme immerses the room in soft textures, starting with the medium wet bar that has recessed row lighting, granite countertops, trendy shelving and modern appliances. To the right of the wet bar are two sliding glass doors leading to a grand walk-out entrance with handrails. The family room has a long white wraparound couch and a projectile home theater along with columns and a billiard table. To the left are plush velvet chairs and marvelous artificial fireplace mounted inside of a mosaic tile wall. Beyond that, through the double doors, lies a full-sized gym with another wall-mounted HDTV.','Basement finishing and remodeling Upper Marlboro, MD, basement renovation Upper Marlboro, MD, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-upper-marlboro-md-17','Basement Remodeling - Home Theater Plus the Gym','','Van Vagner rd, Upper Marlboro, MD','38.7980025','-76.7501614',1,2200,457,'<p>A basement remodel project in Upper Marlboro, MD gets an updated look that is both masculine and modern. Light-colored LVT flooring and a pale blue color scheme immerses the room in soft textures, starting with the medium wet bar that has recessed row lighting, granite countertops, trendy shelving and modern appliances. To the right of the wet bar are two sliding glass doors leading to a grand walk-out entrance with handrails. The family room has a long white wraparound couch and a projectile home theater along with columns and a billiard table. To the left are plush velvet chairs and marvelous artificial fireplace mounted inside of a mosaic tile wall. Beyond that, through the double doors, lies a full-sized gym with another wall-mounted HDTV.</p>\n<p>Featured in: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/prince-george/upper-marlboro\">Basement Finishing in Upper Marlboro, MD</a></p>',1,30,'2020-09-22 16:33:52'),(122,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling in Potomac, MD — Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Maryland, DC and Virginia.','','','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-in-potomac-md','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Potomac, MD','11345 berger terrace potomac MD','39.042681','-77.20337599999999',1,900,485,'',1,7,'2020-09-22 16:36:53'),(123,'Basement Finishing - Room for Ping Pong, Kitchen and a Half bath','A sleek, elegant, and comfortable basement finishing & remodeling project in Frederick MD by BasementRemodeling.com','basement remodeling, basement finishing, basement finishing company, remodel a basement, basement contractor, basement renovation, finished basement, basement refinish','basement-finishing-remodeling-frederick-md-2','Basement Finishing - Room for Ping Pong, Kitchen and a Half bath','','4127 Brushfield Dr, Frederick, MD 21704','39.3460635','-77.3365927',1,1100,490,'<p>A sleek family room is at the heart of this Frederick, MD basement project, complete with wall-mounted HTDV, a wraparound cream couch and twin privacy windows. The high wall trim and raised platform exudes an architectural depth that is only enhanced by the blue-on-white color scheme and elegant recessed lighting. Beige carpet gives way to multi-colored LVT flooring that looks identical to actual stained wood. It\'s the perfect backdrop for a dinning area and full-sized wet bar with wraparound marble counters, vanity sink, and a second large HTDV mounted that\'s against a tiled mosiac accent wall (notice how recessed lighting and a casement window work together in this area to create excellent ambiance). A recreational room has a ping pong table that matches the cerulean blue color scheme, and a snug half-bathroom has LVT flooring, marble sink and triple vanity lamps atop a wide framed mirror.</p>\n<p>Featured in: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/frederick/\">Basement Finishing in Frederick, MD</a></p>',1,49,'2020-09-22 16:38:57'),(124,'Basement Remodel - Kitchenette, Tile and Half Bath | BasementRemodeling.com','This basement remodel in Woodstock, MD includes well-lit family area with double-hung windows, wall-mounted TV. Premium LVT flooring extends into the snazzy kids’ playroom with double pocket doors, and plenty of space for storage. The small kitchenette and dining area. A half bathroom with ceramic mosaic tiled floor.','Basement finishing and remodeling Woodstock MD, basement renovation Woodstock Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-woodstock-kitchenette-tile-bath','Basement Remodel - Kitchenette, Tile and Half Bath','','10741 Red Dahlia dr, Woodstock, MD, 21163','39.3150689','-76.8845719',1,1410,500,'<p>This clean, white basement remodel project in Woodstock, MD begins with a large and well-lit family area with cheerful and charming double-hung windows, an extra-long chocolate loveseat, and an enormous wall-mounted flat screen television. Premium LVT flooring extends into the snazzy kids&rsquo; playroom with double pocket doors, and plenty of space for storage and playtime. The small kitchenette and dining area borrows geometric inspiration from the Art Deco era &ndash; as evidenced by the bold patterns on the wooden tabletop, and the creative overhead light fixture in the shape of a mock lightbulb. A half bathroom with ceramic mosaic tiled floor completes the stylish motif.</p>',1,57,'2020-09-22 16:41:23'),(125,'Basement Finishing - Traditional Kitchen and Full Bath','Looking for great basement lighting ideas? See the best basement design options the East Coast has to offer with this new and elegant Ellicott City, MD basement!','Basement finishing and remodeling, basement renovation, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, best basement design options, Ellicott City MD, Maryland, basement contractor, finished basement portfolio','basement-finishing-remodeling-elliott-city-maryland','Basement Finishing - Traditional Kitchen and Full Bath','','11512 Fox River Dr, Ellicott City, MD 21042','39.2350161','-76.9103774',1,1400,510,'<p>This Ellicott City, MD basement project is loaded with the best basement design options we have to offer. The full-sized kitchen-like wet bar features wraparound marble countertop with stunning tiled accents, matching dark floor and wall cabinetry, modern appliances, hanging vanity lamps and swanky LVT flooring. A wide open teal space with recessed lighting and egress windows feels bright and energetic, as does the tan wing (with matching features and even more window space). A full-sized gym and dance studio combination features a soothing light blue color scheme with gigantic wall mirrors that double the room&rsquo;s size, and triples its functionality. Finally, a bright and creamy full bathroom has a tub enclosure, vanity sink, tiled floor and oval vanity mirror with overhead light fixtures.</p>\n<p>Featured in: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/howard/ellicott-city\">Basement Finishing in Ellicott City</a></p>',1,41,'2020-09-22 16:43:47'),(126,'Basement Finishing - Billiard and Music Rooms with Steam Shower Room','This renovated basement in Alexandria, VA by BasementRemodeling.com has fun activities for everyone in the household.','Basement finishing and remodeling Alexandria VA, basement renovation Alexandria Virginia, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing projects, basement remodeling projects, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-alexandria-va-12-06','Basement Finishing - Billiard and Music Rooms with Steam Shower Room','','2107 Shiver Dr Alexandria, VA 22307','38.7632627','-77.0669921',1,1320,525,'<p>This newly renovated basement project in Alexandria, VA has fun activities for everyone in the household. A spacious family room &ndash; painted a soothing off yellow &ndash; features a dazzling large screen television across from an overstuffed corduroy wraparound sofa. The music room&rsquo;s sweeping architecture provides perfect acoustics for rehearsals in addition to a dramatic visual flair. A wet bar and billiard room, equipped with a regulation-sized pool table and plenty of elbow room, combine to form a trendy lounging area &ndash; sturdy laminate flooring and suspended bar lamps provides the perfect sporty feel. The upgraded bathroom is richly steeped in sharp angles, giving a sense of unparalleled depth and elegance. A contemporary steam shower produces humidifying water vapors that relax and reinvigorate.</p>',1,48,'2020-09-22 16:46:17'),(127,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project in Laytonsville, Maryland','Are you looking for basement design ideas to turn your downstairs into the ultimate bachelor’s pad? Check out this Laytonsville, MD basement!','Basement finishing and remodeling, basement renovation, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, contemporary basement design, Laytonsville MD','basement-finishing-remodeling-laytonsville-maryland','Basement Renovation - Decorative Columns, TV Mount and Light Cabinets','','24222 PRIMULA COURT LAYTONSVILLE, MD 20882','39.257853','-77.18057000000002',1,2000,541,'<p>Double doors give way to a masculine Laytonsville, MD basement project that commands respect with sharp corners and dark undertones. Contemporary decorative columns form full angles against a dramatic grey backdrop with room-expanding white walls and recessed lighting. LVT flooring flows under a medium-sized wet bar complete with wine storage, dishwasher, marble countertop, vanity faucet, light cabinets and a trendy contemporary decorative mirror with a glass-paneled frame. A corner family room has a wall-mounted HDTV to watch all of your latest entertainment, but most would probably prefer to go into the two-toned theater room complete with a projector unit, large screen and hidden LED lighting. A long storage room with wired shelving and LVT flooring has plenty of room for all of your capacity needs, and a full bathroom is light and airy with a soft grey-on-white design with tiled</p>',0,68,'2020-09-22 16:50:58'),(128,'Basement Remodeling - Kids Playroom and Built In Shelving','A beautifully crafted basement finishing and remodeling project in Ellicott City, Maryland by Basement Remodeling Company.','Basement finishing and remodeling Ellicott City MD, basement renovation Ellicott City Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-ellicott-city-md-13-06','Basement Remodeling - Kids Playroom and Built In Shelving','','5019 Amber Meadow ,ellicott city,MD, 21043','39.2422692','-76.7991303',1,1420,556,'<p>From the stunning entrance lobby (with tile flooring and wardrobe cubbies) to the heartwarming family room (with fireplace and shelving), timeless French double doors give this dazzling Ellicott City, MD basement renovation project a touch of class as you move room to room. Dual leather loveseats face an oversized HTDV, which is framed in a clean white entertainment cabinet with ample shelving. A miniature playhouse with an accompanying &ldquo;window&rdquo; built into the wall of the kids&rsquo; playroom turns this remarkable play place into a &ldquo;home within a home&rdquo; &ndash; literally! A bathroom with tub enclosure by Kohler and a beautiful beige matching granite countertop.</p>\n<p>Featured in: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/howard/ellicott-city\">Basement Finishing in Ellicott City</a></p>',0,59,'2020-09-22 16:53:06'),(129,'Basement Remodel - Airy Office, Bedroom and Full Kitchen','This Mount Airy, MD basement remodel is a combination of tasteful, elegant, and untraditional. BasementRemodeling.com','Basement finishing and remodeling Mount Airy MD, basement renovation Mount Airy Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-mount-airy-md-15-06','Basement Remodel - Small Office, Bedroom and Full Kitchen','','5915 Woodville Rd Mount Airy MD 21771','39.3947809','-77.181376',1,980,562,'<p>A bright and flashy loft in Mount Airy, MD shows that not all basements remodeling projects have to follow the rules and be ordinary. A tasteful flight of stairs with iron spindles leads to an untraditional bedroom with hidden access doors and stunning grape purple accent wall. The soft and airy family room is ivory with a robin egg blue accent wall, and stretches into a small office stocked with all of the latest work-related equipment. A bright and cheerful bathroom with tub enclosure and elevated window shares the robin-egg-and-ivory color patterns. The kitchen-like wet bar has a full-sized fridge, stainless steel dishwasher and microwave.</p>',1,94,'2020-09-22 16:54:56'),(130,'Basement Finishing - Stair Railing, Large Family Room and White Bathroom ','This basement in Rockville, MD includes stair railings with iron spindles descend into a huge family room, which utilizes premium LVT. Two separate seating areas. A luxurious, bathroom features a fanciful ceramic tiled shower with inviting glass doors.','Basement finishing and remodeling Rockville MD, basement renovation Rockville Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-rockville-md-15-05','Basement Finishing - Stair Railing, Large Family Room and White Bathroom ','','6130 Lux Lane Rockville, Md 20852','39.03431620000001','-77.1286293',1,950,573,'<p>The sheer size of this beautiful basement project in Rockville, MD is sure to impress anyone who lays eyes upon it. Lavish stair railings with iron spindles descend into a huge family room, which utilizes premium LVT planks for the best look and feel. The family area is large enough to accommodate two separate seating areas &ndash; so big, in fact, that the sectional sofa becomes dwarfed in comparison to the wide open space surrounding it. A luxurious, all-white washroom features a fanciful ceramic tiled shower with inviting glass doors. Overall, a roomy dwelling that has a terrific look and feel.</p>',1,62,'2020-09-22 16:56:43'),(131,'Rustic Basement Remodel','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD. Double French doors, built-in fireplace and a gently swaying ceiling fan. The living room is quite spacious and features laminate flooring, wonderful wet bar and kitchenette combo.','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD, basement renovation Columbia Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-columbia-md-13-06','Rustic Basement Remodel','','10925 Shadow ln, Columbia, 21044','39.1974202','-76.89067419999999',1,1030,584,'<p>This refined and rustic remodeling project utilizes simple, wide open spaces to its fullest potential for a timeless, elegant look. As soon as they walk through the window-encased double French doors, your family and friends are welcomed immediately by a built-in fireplace and a gently swaying ceiling fan. The cream-themed paint job fully opens the room, and the laminate flooring is a low-cost material that is easy to install and especially resistant to scuffs &ndash; and just look at that polished shine! The living room is quite spacious and features a fully-mounted flat screen HDTV before effortlessly expanding into a wonderful wet bar and kitchenette combo.</p>\n<p>Featured in: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/howard/columbia\">Basement Finishing in Columbia, Maryland</a></p>',0,91,'2020-09-22 16:59:13'),(132,'Basement Remodel - Dark Rustic Kitchen, Carpeted Steps','Looking for beautifully designed basement design ideas? Check out this Columbia, Maryland basement project by BasementRemodeling.com!','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD, basement renovation Columbia Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-remodeling-columbia-maryland-2','Basement Remodel - Dark Rustic Kitchen, Carpeted Steps','','5505 Tang pl, Columbia, 21045','39.2164731','-76.8067014',1,1200,599,'<p>A contrasting color scheme gives this Columbia, MD basement project an immaculate appearance full of warmth and rich textures. Carpeted steps pop against the light and grainy LVT flooring, which curves left to reveal a delightful full-sized wet bar replete with dark cabinetry, light marble countertops with raised second level, wine cabinet and custom made wine closet, angled HDTV screen, and wraparound stacked stone walls. On the adjacent side is a wide open solid slate gray space that would make for a delightful family room, games room, kids&rsquo; playroom, and any other great basement ideas. The guest bedroom is a light gray with white trimming and has a large corner window along with carpet that matches the stairway. A beautiful robin&rsquo;s egg blue full bathroom has an extra wide vanity sink with marble countertop, tiled flooring, and shower enclosure with sliding glass doors.</p>',0,58,'2020-09-22 17:00:26'),(133,'Basement Finishing - Wine Cellar next to Family Room','You’ll be jealous that you didn’t think of these great basement ideas first with this Falls Church, VA basement redesign! Come see what we can do for you.','Basement finishing and remodeling, basement renovation, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement redesign ideas, Falls Church VA, Virginia, Virginia basement remodeling, basement finishing company','basement-finishing-wine-cellar-falls-church-maryland','Basement Finishing - Wine Cellar next to Family Room','','2574 Holly Manor Dr, Falls Church, VA 22043','38.8845079','-77.20892119999999',1,1250,611,'<p>Rich undertones highlight a Falls Church, VA basement project with ample space and excellent recessed lighting. Immediately after descending the stair railings with half-wall, guests come face-to-face with a high-volume temperature-controlled wine cellar with beige stacked stone walls and dark LVT flooring. The dark LVT tiling extends into the main area and stops at the decorative column and light carpet, on the other side of which is a family room and gym combination. Plush furniture is positioned into a conversational family room setting with a high egress window to let plenty of natural light in. The colors brighten considerably to give positive energy in the bedroom (with double-doored closet), which is connected to a full-sized bathroom with light blue walls, tan tiled floor and extra-wide counter, and a shower enclosure with sliding glass door.</p>\n<p>Featured in: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/va/falls-church/\">Basement Finishing in Falls Church, VA</a></p>',0,73,'2020-09-22 17:03:55'),(134,'Finished Basement with A Wine Cellar','Children and adults alike would love this wide open basement in Bethesda, Maryland!','Basement renovation, basement remodeling, basement finishing, bethesda, maryland','basement-finishing-remodeling-bethesda-md-2','Finished Basement with A Wine Cellar','','6204 Waldonding Rd, Bethesda, MD, 20816','38.9640509','-77.1264269',1,1100,627,'<p>Children and adults alike will love this wide open basement project in Bethesda, Maryland. Mom and dad can enjoy the family room (with a wooden entertainment center and marble countertop, widescreen HDTV, and LVT flooring) while keeping an eye on the little ones just around the decorative column in the adjacent kids\' playroom (complete with matching LVT flooring, white trim, and a delightful stenciled mock house entrance that\'s perfect for both storage and play). A full-sized wet bar seamlessly separates the family room using wraparound counters and marble countertops. A full bathroom comes complete with LVT tiling, tiled shower enclosure, marble sinktops and vanity lamps. Best of all, down the wooden stairs with wrought iron railings and beyond the glass door, lies a full wine cellar with climate controls.</p>',0,101,'2020-09-22 17:05:52'),(135,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #3 - North Potomac, MD','This North Potomac, MD remodel includes a spacious family room with LVT flooring, kitchen-like wet bar and an aged cabinetry case. The laundry nook with utility sink is perfectly concealed by a modest privacy wall. Full bathroom with a shower enclosure.','Basement finishing and remodeling North Potomac MD, basement renovation North Potomac Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-north-potomac-md-16-01','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #3','North Potomac, MD','14220 Quince Orchard rd North Potomac MD 20878','39.0894668','-77.25124679999999',1,1040,630,'<p>If you are looking for a contemporary basement design that&rsquo;s both modern and masculine, this North Potomac, MD remodel project is the perfect source of inspiration for you. Rustic brown leather furniture over dark LVT planking and sunflower yellow walls creates a family room and kitchen-like wet bar with rich depths and touchable textures. An aged cabinetry case, Jamaican blue, breaks up the pleasantly monochromatic presentation. The laundry nook with working basin is perfectly concealed by a modest privacy wall. Across is the upgraded bathroom with a shower enclosure for an open feel. The refreshing look of this peaceful and relaxing den promotes both good nature and good health.</p>',0,112,'2020-09-22 17:07:27'),(136,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project in Pasadena, Maryland','Your Pasadena, MD basement design can have a cutting-edge design with these contemporary ideas by BasementRemodeling.com!','Contemporary basement ideas, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, Pasadena, MD, Maryland, Maryland basement contractor, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor','basement-finishing-remodeling-pasadena-maryland','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Pasadena, Maryland','311 Gold Brush Way, Pasadena, MD 21122','39.1269881','-76.5585993',1,1050,645,'<p>One look at the cutting-edge design of this sky blue Pasadena, MD basement project and you&rsquo;ll never look back at your old basement design again. Contemporary basement ideas blend walls and ceiling glide into congruence thanks to outstanding contemporary architecture and trendy recessed lighting tricks. The medium kitchen-like wet bar has dark cabinetry with a contrasting tiled accent wall, wine storage with glass, elevated microwave and tight LVT flooring cutaway that matches the walls. A full bathroom pops with metallic blue floors and walls, tiled flooring, squared vanity overhead lights and tub enclosure by Kohler.</p>',0,102,'2020-09-22 17:09:11'),(137,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - District Heights, MD','Clean and bright basement refinishing and remodeling project in District Heights MD by BasementRemodeling.com','Basement finishing and remodeling District Heights MD, basement renovation District Heights MD, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor, stand-alone columns, wet-bar, egress window','basement-finishing-remodeling-in-district-heights-md','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','District Heights, MD','6201 Elmhurst St, District Heights, MD, 20747','38.8560863','-76.9004463',1,1287,653,'<p>A clean and bright basement design project for a home in District Heights, MD by BasementRemodeling.com. The basement features stand-alone columns, high-quality LVT flooring, a mid-size wet bar,&nbsp;a&nbsp;laundry room,&nbsp;a half bathroom, and a large bedroom with a new-installed egress window.</p>\r\n<p>Aside from a wet-bar with custom cabinets and a mini-fridge, the most noticeable aspect about the living room is its extensive use of stand-alone columns. Stand-alone columns are both decoratively beautiful and offer practical applications, especially when it comes to designing the layout of your furniture! The half bathroom maintains the same delightful aesthetic as the rest of the basement, with a beautiful marble-topped cabinet with a sink and unique tile flooring.</p>\r\n<p>The entire basement measures 1,287 square feet and, though that is large already, clever design features make it feel much larger!</p>',0,80,'2020-09-22 17:11:26'),(138,'Playful Basement Renovation','Basement remodeling and finishing project in Germantown, Maryland | Basement Remodeling Company','basement remodeling project germantown MD, Germantown, MD, Maryland, Germantown basement project, basement finishing project, basement remodeling project, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-remodeling-germantown-2-md','Playful Basement Renovation','','18008 Coachmans Rd, Germantown, MD, 20874','39.1540029','-77.29221079999999',1,1400,682,'<p>A basement project in Germantown, MD has a unique style that has to be seen to be believed. Pale yellow walls with white trim and recessed lighting leaves endless design possibilities &ndash; in this case, a kitchen-like wet bar with modern appliances, sink with vanity faucet, and marble countertop sits across from the kids\' playroom (which has a delightfully modern-looking mock house stencil with an adorable mail box and an openable red door kid\'s entrance that leads into a whole other full-sized kids\' playroom or storage room)! Meanwhile, behind the wooden double doors is another large room that could comfortably serve as a secluded guest bedroom or as the ultimate storage room (notice the understairs storage as well). Across from the mock house entrance is a family room with wall-mounted HDTV and hookups for a full entertainment center. A full bathroom with pale yellow walls sharply contrasts with a clean white marble countertop, white tiled flooring and a tiled shower with tub enclosure by Kohler.</p>\n<p>Featured in: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/montgomery/germantown\">Basement Finishing in Germantown, Maryland</a></p>',0,106,'2020-09-22 17:12:53'),(139,'Basement Remodeling in Alexandria, VA — Basement Remodeling in Maryland, DC and Virginia.','','Basement finishing and remodeling Alexandria, VA, basement renovation Alexandria, VA, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement remodeling, basement finishing, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-remodeling-in-alexandria-va','Basement Remodeling','Alexandria, VA','2001 Commonwealth Avenue, Alexandria, VA, 22301','38.8237075','-77.06254009999999',1,576,701,'',0,29,'2020-09-22 17:14:21'),(140,'Basem