ille-md-14-07','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #3','Clarksville, MD','7250 Meadow Wood Way, Clarksville,Md, 21029','39.1747752','-76.9231173',1,750,725,'<p>Simple sophistication is the theme of this elegant Clarksville, MD basement renovation project, which shows how proper lighting can make a downstairs dwelling truly shine. Extra-large, semi-flush ceiling lights adorn a spacious wet bar area, replete with granite countertops, modern amenities, sapphire blue walls, and peace yellow cabinetry. The bedroom is crocodile green with white trimming for an organic, outdoorsy feel; double-hung French windows, inlaid ceiling lamps, and door-mounted mirrors open the room to its fullest potential (and provide plenty of breathing room). The full-sized bathroom with tiled walls is especially bright and cheerful thanks to an abundance of well-placed windows and square ceiling-mounted LED panel lamps.</p>',0,55,'2020-09-22 17:21:07'),(143,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project in West Friendship, Maryland','Looking to redesign your basement into a contemporary haven that looks like nothing you’ve seen before? Check out these basement ideas in West Friendship, MD!','Basement finishing and remodeling, basement renovation, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, contemporary basement design, West Friendship MD, Maryland, basement finishing contractor, basement, remodeling, finished, remodeled, redesigned, contractor','basement-finishing-remodeling-west-friendship-maryland','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','West Friendship, Maryland','2721 Friendship Farm Ct, West Friendship, MD 21794','39.2908975','-76.94886749999999',1,1150,736,'<p>A contemporary design scheme gives this West Friendship, MD basement project a subtle flair that is hard to look away from! The monochromatic blue color scheme is broken up by soft recessed lighting, light LVT flooring and royal blue seating furniture. The stairway railing with half-walls entrance looks narrow and elongated due to angled architecture, but is actually quite wide open and spacious. As the eye navigates the twists and turns, it creates more space, as evidenced by an engaging corner with an extra-low window and ceiling fan with exaggeratedly-angled blades; the lone refrigerator could easily be redesigned into a small kitchen-like wet bar at a later time if desired. A matching blue full bathroom features tiled flooring, dark</p>',0,93,'2020-09-22 17:23:13'),(144,'Basement Renovation - Built In Shelving and Cabinets with a Small Kitchenette','This Potomac, MD basement by BasementRemodeling.com has wall-to-wall shelving and floor cabinets dotting the family room.','Basement finishing and remodeling Potomac MD, basement renovation Potomac Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement remodeling, basement finishing, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-potomac-md-15-03','Basement Renovation - Built In Shelving and Cabinets with a Small Kitchenette','','11711 Stoney Creek Rd., Potomac, MD 20854','39.047363','-77.260036',1,530,745,'<p>Not all basements need to be unconventional to stand out. This Potomac, MD basement project upgrade features the traditional charm of a classic basement while adding some practical new touches. Soft lighting and a chestnut color scheme&nbsp;offers&nbsp;the perfect backdrop for making family memories that will last a lifetime. Wall-to-wall shelving and floor cabinets dot the family room (with wall-mounted television), providing plenty of easily organizable storage spaces. Just past the column, a slim corner kitchenette includes fanciful cabinets, stainless steel appliances, and a sleek wooden counter surface. This artfully minimalist design provides ample space at an affordable price tag.</p>',0,72,'2020-09-22 17:24:35'),(145,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project Ashton, MD | Basement Masters','This remodeled Ashton, MD basement has a uniquely scenic family room with fireplace. An office with dropped-in ceiling and copper-colored panels, along with LVT flooring. The neutral-themed laundry room in front of a small workshop with wooden bench, storage locker, and ample shelving. The full bathroom has a tiled tub surround, ornamental bowl sink, dark gray LVT flooring and decorative plant life.','Basement finishing and remodeling Ashton MD, basement renovation Ashton Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-ashton-md-16-01','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Ashton, MD','36 ORION CLUB DR ASHTON, MD 20861','39.150869','-77.014102',1,640,751,'<p>This earthy downstairs den project in Ashton, MD captures a powerful and rustic beauty for a truly outdoorsy feel. Pine green walls, cotton white ceiling and cream carpet all blend to create a uniquely scenic family room with fireplace. An office with dropped-in ceiling and copper-colored panels, along with LVT flooring, creates a uniform workspace full of contemporary textures and designs. The neutral-themed laundry room with washer and dryer also doubles as a small workshop with wooden bench, storage locker, and ample shelving. The full bathroom continues the organic motif with tiled tub surround, ornamental bowl sink, dark gray LVT flooring and decorative plant life.&nbsp;</p>',0,98,'2020-09-22 17:28:45'),(146,'Basement Finishing - Movie Theater','This luxurious Germantown, MD basement remodel by BasementRemodeling.com features a home theater room, small wet bar, wine rack storage, and more!','Basement finishing and remodeling Germantown MD, basement renovation Germantown Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, basement portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-germantown-md-15-12','Basement Finishing - Movie Theater','','11303 Willowdale dr Germantown MD 20876','39.1731079','-77.23178120000001',1,1340,762,'<p>Why shouldn&rsquo;t your basement be as luxurious as the rest of your home? As this Germantown, MD basement project shows, your downstairs area can be so much more than just storage space. For starters, how about a home theater room with doublewide leather armchairs, recessed ceiling, cinema lighting and a wall-to-wall projection screen? Take a brief intermission at the small wet bar with glass block window cabinets, marble countertops, private sink and overhead wine rack storage. The luxury continues with a neutral-themed full bathroom complete with steam shower, glass shower door with vanity knob, curved bowl sink, faux wood tile flooring, and large wall mirror with decorative borders. A clean and modest laundry room makes practical use of the remaining floor space.</p>',0,61,'2020-09-22 17:30:17'),(147,'Basement Finishing and Remodeling Project in Marriotsville, MD','This Marriotsville, MD remodel/finish by BasementRemodeling.com has a family room with a full-size wet bar, LVT flooring, and more.','Basement finishing and remodeling Marriotsville MD, basement renovation Marriotsville Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, basement portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-marriotsville-md-14-06','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Marriotsville, MD','11246 GENTLE ROLLING DR, MARRIOTSVILLE,MD,21104','39.31050520000001','-76.9046566',1,1650,782,'<p>This peppy&nbsp;Marriotsville, MD basement project mixes an upscale look with a&nbsp;downhome&nbsp;design that is warm, lively and eventful. A tactful family room, painted neutral colors, features a tray ceiling and clean white floor-and-chair-rail trimming that showcases the space&rsquo;s open floorplan flawlessly. Adjacent from a beautiful decorative column, slate gray countertops wrap around a full-sized wet bar with LVT flooring, glass-windowed&nbsp;cabinetry&nbsp;and modern hanging lamps. A fun arts and crafts room (tailor&rsquo;s shop) exudes a traditional American energy with vibrant colors, classic wall-to-wall wooden cabinetry, LVT flooring, and tray ceiling with recessed lights. Finally, the full bathroom has retractable shutter blinds, a tiled surround shower with glass double doors, and LVT flooring.</p>',0,78,'2020-09-22 17:31:34'),(148,'Basement Remodeling - Entertainment Room','Basement finishing and remodeling Silver Spring MD. A recessed ceiling with hidden LED lights (rope lights) in the family room, LTV planking, and a wall-mounted TV. Walk-up wet bar with plenty of wine storage and countertop surface space. The full bathroom features ceramic tiling and a tub enclosure.','Basement finishing and remodeling Silver Spring MD, basement renovation Silver Spring Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-silver-spring-md-14-12','Basement Remodeling - Entertainment Room','','14621 Carona Drive, Silver Spring, MD 20905','39.099071','-77.025438',1,980,785,'<p>A recessed ceiling with hidden LED lights (rope lights) and a tasteful blend of earthy tones adds astonishing amounts of depth and livability to this Silver Spring, MD basement redesign project. The family room features plush sectional seating, richly-textured LTV planking, and a wall-mounted HDTV with accompanying entertainment cabinetry. Guests can help themselves at a walk-up wet bar with plenty of wine storage and countertop surface space. With added soundproofing measurements, the noise level will never be a problem for neighbors or even other members in the home. The full bathroom features ceramic tiling, white floor trimming on a medallion yellow backdrop, and a tub enclosure.&nbsp;</p>',0,84,'2020-09-22 17:34:08'),(149,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project, Greenbelt, Maryland| Basement Masters','Sometimes you don’t need to use walls to divide up a space. Learn how to use bright color combinations to your advantage like this basement in Greenbelt, MD!','Basement finishing and remodeling, basement renovation, finishing basem