, tiled flooring, and a sophisticated black-and-white color scheme.</p>',0,85,'2020-09-22 17:40:09'),(153,'Sleek Basement Design - Recessed Ceiling, LVT Planking','This Arlington, VA basement remodel features the recessed ceiling, well-placed columns and a dual-chain chandelier. The wet bar features modern appliances, twin vanity faucets, and artificially-aged LVT flooring. The full bathroom features an elite bowl sink, tiled floors, and a shower enclosure with twin sliding glass doors.','Basement finishing and remodeling Arlington VA, basement renovation Arlington Virginia, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-arlington-va-14-02','Sleek Basement Design - Recessed Ceiling, LVT Planking','','6701 25th St N Arlington, VA 22213','38.8916827','-77.16112100000001',1,2090,839,'<p>Monochromatic color patterns and a layered architectural design makes this one of the sleekest basement projects in all of Arlington, VA. The recessed ceiling creates a spectacular visual depth that elongates the area and emphasizes spatial awareness. Well-placed columns and a dual-chain chandelier adds a touch of elegance and class without being overly showy, and the dark furniture choice lends a richly dramatic flair to the overall aesthetic. The wet bar features modern appliances, twin vanity faucets, and artificially-aged LVT planking for a timeless sophistication. The full bathroom features an elite bowl sink, tiled floors, and a shower enclosure with twin sliding glass doors and a detachable shower wand. Stylish, bold, and unique!</p>',0,90,'2020-09-22 17:41:36'),(154,'Basement finishing and remodeling project, Beltsville MD| Basement Masters','This basement in Beltsville, MD features the family room, which is complete with sofa, coffee table and column; twin bookshelves beautifully frame a sizeable wall-mounted TV and a stylish entertainment cabinet. The spacious game room, with a ping pong and an air hockey table, throwing darts! Resilient LVT planks 