athroom features a tiled shower with granite curb, tile flooring, and a daisy white marble countertop on top of jet black cabinets.</p>',0,96,'2020-09-22 17:51:27'),(157,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project','This basement remodel in Silver Spring, MD features the full-size wet bar area, which has tile flooring breaking up the carpeting. Under the stairs, a little closet makes sure that every corner looks fun while being put to good use. Dark LVT planking compliments the lilac-painted dancing room.','Basement finishing and remodeling Silver Spring MD, basement renovation Silver Spring Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-silver-spring-md-16-01','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #2','','1504 Hideaway place, Silver Spring MD 20906','39.0780789','-77.0358624',1,1400,878,'<p>Classic and contemporary best describes this crisp and clean basement project in Silver Spring, MD. Sharp architectural angles and raised marble&nbsp;countertops&nbsp;highlight the full-size wet bar area, which fits snug in the center of a wide open, cream-colored space &ndash; notice the bare patch of tile flooring breaking up the carpeting, how chic! Under the stairs, a little closet makes sure that every corner looks fun while being put to good use. Dark LVT planking compliments the lilac-painted dancing room, which has a stunning two-toned support beam and wall-to-wall studio mirroring, the same as professional dancers use!</p>',0,114,'2020-09-22 17:53:16'),(158,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project in Edgewater, Maryland','If you are looking for professional basement finishing and remodeling ideas in Edgewater, MD, you’ve got to see this fully finished basement!','basement remodeling ideas, basement finishing, kitchen-like wet bar, decorative column, LVT tiling, basement portfolio, project, edgewater MD, Maryland, Edgewater basement, design, contractor','basement-finishing-remodeling-edgewater-maryland','Basement Fini