. The basement ensemble is completed by a steel blue full bathroom with vanity lamps, luxury sink basin, and tub enclosure by Kohler.</p>',0,66,'2020-09-22 17:58:26'),(160,'Basement Renovation Project ','Come see what Basement Masters has done to this Bowie, MD basement – and what they can do for yours!','Basement finishing and remodeling, basement renovation, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, Bowie MD','basement-finishing-remodeling-bowie-maryland','Basement Renovation Project ','','11905 Webb Court, Bowie, MD','39.0012763','-76.7994006',1,1180,920,'<p>A basement project in Bowie, MD is fully revitalized with a double-door entranceway that segues from the outside into an artic blue wonderland with bright white ceilings and floor trim, LVT flooring, a decorative column, and a refrigerator unit neatly tucked away in a pocket corner. The stair railing with half-wall effortlessly glides upstairs. In the next room over, things suddenly turn delightfully terra cotta with white trim and ceiling, a push-out window and recessed lighting. The full-sized bathroom is delightfully modern with a slate blue walls and tile floors, shower enclosure with sliding glass door, and deluxe pop-out medicine cabinet with vanity mirror.</p>\n<p>Featured in:<a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/prince-george/bowie\"> Basement Remodeling in Bowie, MD</a></p>',0,108,'2020-09-22 18:01:08'),(161,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #3 - Fulton, Maryland','Clean cream colors gives this Fulton, Maryland basement a crisp and uniform appearance that offers a balanced and well-organized first impression.','Basement remodeling, basement renovation, basement finish, general contractor, project, fulton, maryland','basement-finishing-remodeling-fulton-2-md','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #3','Fulton, Maryland','761 Aspring Ave, Fulton, MD 20759','39.1605745','-76.91047139999999',1,1200,935,'<p>Clean cream colors gives this Fulton, Maryland basement project a cri