serves as an excellent centerpiece to both frame the basement and create an imaginary boundary leading into the medium-sized wet bar, which is replete with wine rack, floor and wall cabinetry, marble countertop, and modern appliances (note how the LVT flooring and tiled accent wall combine to add movement and flow). Twin half-walls with columns and a high archway combine to create a space that is pleasantly closed off yet quite visible. A full bathroom with LVT flooring, Kohler tub enclosure and a brilliant marble countertop (with matching shower curtains) pair the perfect basement ideas together to add the final touch.</p>',0,89,'2020-09-22 18:13:44'),(167,'Basement TV Setup in A Yellow Home Theater ','This basement remodel in Annapolis, MD basement has a video games playroom with triple HDTVs mounted onto the wall, leather armchairs with built-in drink holders, and a recessed ceiling with LED lighting and built-in speakers. A wet bar includes a wine rack, stainless steel appliances, and sleek black marble counter. The full bathroom features a tiled shower with mosaic tile on the walls and floor, marble curb and glass doors.','Basement finishing and remodeling Annapolis MD, basement renovation Annapolis Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-tv-setup','Basement TV Setup in A Yellow Home Theater ','','516 Tremont cir, Annapolis, MD 21409','39.0321323','-76.46462799999999',1,1600,992,'<p>Every night will be &ldquo;game night&rdquo; in this bright and stunning Annapolis, MD basement project. The inviting video games playroom has triple HDTVs mounted onto the wall, an oversized leather sectional sofa with built-in drink holders, and a recessed ceiling with LED lighting and built-in speakers. The two-toned lemon-yellow-on-white color scheme extends into a remarkable family room with egress window. A nearby wet bar with wine rack, stainless steel appliances, and sleek black marble counter surface is perfect for extended conversation. The full bathroom features the same stylish colors as the rest of the basement, along with a tiled shower with mosaic tile on the walls and floor, marble&nbsp;curb&nbsp;and glass doors.</p>\n<p>For more great works from this area, chek out our <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/anne-arundel/annapolis\">basement remodeling jos in Annapolis, Maryland</a>.</p>',0,111,'2020-09-22 18:15:26'),(168,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #3 - Potomac, MD','Simple meets chic for a Potomac, MD basement design that has excellent window ideas and shows how decorative columns can break up open space and avoid monotony!','Basement finishing and remodeling, basement renovation, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement architecture, Potomac MD','basement-finishing-remodeling-potomac-maryland','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #3','Potomac, MD','1105 Cedrus Way Rockville, MD 20854','39.0731917','-77.17015239999999',1,1000,1009,'<p>This Potomac, MD basement project has a picture-perfect entrance thanks to dual double-hung windows on both sides of a doorway that juts slightly further in &ndash; classic! Twin decorative columns separate the games room (with ping pong table and sitting area) from the family room, which has a wall-mounted HDTV and hookups for a full entertainment system. A uniform light grey appearance throughout extends into the bathroom, which has a tub enclosure with shower lighting, extra-wide wash basin and vanity canister lights.</p>',0,104,'2020-09-22 18:17:11'),(169,'Urban style basement finishing in Washington, DC','An attractive and urban style finished basement in Washington, DC. Expertly designed and implemented by BasementRemodeling.com.','Basement finishing and remodeling Washington, DC, basement renovation Washington, DC, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement remodeling, basement finishing, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-remodeling-washington-dc-19-04','Basement Remodel