floor.</p>',0,126,'2020-09-22 18:20:26'),(171,'Basement Remodeling in Washington DC — Basement Finishing and Remodeling in Maryland, DC and Virginia.','','','basement-remodeling-in-washington-dc','Basement Remodeling','','622 Orleans Pl NE, Washington, DC, 20002','38.905144','-76.99756099999999',1,350,1037,'',0,120,'2020-09-22 18:21:57'),(172,'Basement Renovation - Ellicott City, MD','This Ellicott City, MD basement remodel features a professional side office. When the day’s work is finished, a home theatre room awaits, fully equipped with a ceiling-mounted projector and screen, foldout ping pong table, recessed ceiling, and functional shelving under the stairs space. The full bathroom includes a tub enclosure, patterned ceramic tiling, and white granite countertop.','Basement finishing and remodeling Ellicott City MD, basement renovation Ellicott City Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-ellicott-city-md-16-03-1','Basement Renovation','Ellicott City, MD','9312 Rock Meadow Dr, Ellicott City, MD 21042','39.2652459','-76.83431399999999',1,660,1046,'<p>Who says that you can&rsquo;t mix business with pleasure? This Ellicott City, MD remodel project features a professional side office, painted Sunday green, with column and white trimming, offset by striking black office equipment and work desk. When the day&rsquo;s work is finished, however, a neutral-toned home theatre room awaits, fully equipped with a ceiling-mounted projector and screen, foldout ping pong table, recessed ceiling, and functional shelving under the stairs space. The full bathroom includes a tub enclosure, patterned ceramic tiling, and white granite countertop. With this transitional basement, there&rsquo;s plenty of time for work and play!</p>\n<p>Featured in: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/howard/ellicott-city\">Basement Finishing in Ellicott City</a></p>',0,122,'2020-09-22 18:23:27'),(173,'Basement Renovation - Spiral Stair