l a beautiful walk-in closet with trendy wire racks. The full bathroom is a stunning shade of spring&nbsp;green,&nbsp;and features a tiled floor, new shower enclosure, and an immaculate white marble countertop with dark and luxurious cabinets.</p>\n<p>Featured in:<a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/prince-george/bowie\"> Basement Remodeling in Bowie, MD</a></p>',0,124,'2020-09-22 18:36:03'),(176,'Finished Basement Gym and Movie Theater','This Ellicott City, MD basement remodel has a home theatre room, which features raised flooring, a projector unit, a professional sound system, home viewing screen, and adjustable cinematic lighting. A gym room with a cycling fitness station, and a ping pong room. An all-purpose lounge area with tile flooring and small wet bar, and a full teal bathroom features granite countertops, a tub enclosure, and tile flooring.  ','Basement finishing and remodeling Ellicott City MD, basement renovation Ellicott City Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-ellicott-city-md-16-03-2','Finished Basement Gym and Movie Theater','','4916 Valley View Overlook, Ellicott City, MD 21042','39.2337743','-76.9075385',1,2300,1089,'<p>This all-in-one Ellicott City, MD basement remodel project has everything you need to stay in shape, keep entertained, and throw the best parties in your neighborhood! Each room has its own dramatic look and feel, starting with the royal purple home theatre room, which features raised flooring, a projector unit, a professional sound system, home viewing screen, and adjustable cinematic lighting.&nbsp; When you are done eating popcorn, a carrot orange gym room with a cycling fitness station, and a pineapple yellow ping pong&nbsp;room,&nbsp;are perfect solutions for keeping those calories off. An all-purpose lounge area with tile flooring and small wet bar tops off the recreational possibilities, and a full teal bathroom features granite countertops, a tub enclosure, and tile flooring. &nbsp;</p>\n<p>Featured in: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/howard/ellicott-city\">Finished Basements in Ellicott City</a></p>',0,127,'2020-09-22 18:38:07'),(177,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #9 ','This Ellicott City, MD basement remodeling includes a family room, which is complete with a wall-mounted entertainment system. In addition to traditional kids’ playroom, there is another small kids’ room under the stairs. An upgraded full bathroom with ceramic tiled shower with marble curb.','Basement finishing and remodeling Ellicott City MD, basement renovation Ellicott City Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-ellicott-city-md-14-10','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #9','','5023 Amber Meadow Vista, Ellicott city, MD,21043','39.2420957','-76.7989607',1,1320,1100,'<p>Artistic and inviting describes this Ellicott City, MD basement remodeling project, which utilizes sparse decorations and natural accents to create seemingly infinite amounts of space. Clear and modern lines and a light color pattern gives an upbeat feel to the expansive family room, which is complete with a wall-mounted entertainment system. The children are especially lucky &ndash; in additional to traditional kids&rsquo; playroom, there is another small kids&rsquo; room under the stairs with a stenciled tree on the wall and a starry twilight backdrop on the ceiling. An upgraded bathroom with honey-colored walls and ceramic tiled shower with marble curb completes the pleasing aesthetic.</p>',0,69,'2020-09-22 18:40:14'),(178,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #8','For this basement in Ellicott City, MD, twin decorative columns boldly outline a spacious family room area that also has a wall-mounted HDTV, white trim, and a dark wooden cabinet entertainment center.','basement remodeling, basement renovation, basement finishing, general contractor, basement project, elliott city, maryl