athroom has a tiled floor, vanity lighting, and a tub enclosure by Kohler.</p>',0,129,'2020-09-22 18:44:00'),(180,'Basement Redesign - Kitchenette, Full Bathroom and Living Room','This Columbia, MD basement has a cherry red love seat. LVT flooring and a delightful kitchenette with overhead cabinets, a full-sized stainless steel refrigerator unit, and a microwave that’s perfect for fun snacks and quick meals. A full bathroom includes tiled shower (with frameless door) and marble tile flooring.','Basement finishing and remodeling Columbia MD, basement renovation Columbia Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-columbia-md-15-01','Basement Redesign - Kitchenette, Full Bathroom and Living Room','','5215 Durham Road East, Columbia, MD 21044','39.22740960000001','-76.8638532',1,820,1129,'<p>With a basement like this Columbia, MD redesign project, your home will truly give others a great impression from the ground up! A cherry red love seat pops against the family room&rsquo;s soft green interior walls, and dual decorative beams accentuate a clean design that has plenty of architectural&nbsp;flair&nbsp;to offer. LVT flooring effortlessly carries you into a delightful kitchenette with overhead cabinets, a full-sized stainless steel refrigerator unit, and a microwave that&rsquo;s perfect for fun snacks and quick meals. A full bathroom includes tiled shower (with frameless door), marble tile flooring and an immaculate eggshell white finish.</p>',0,130,'2020-09-22 18:45:59'),(181,'Basement Remodel - Walkout, Wet Bar and a Blue Bathroom ','A basement in Washington DC turned into an apartment with plenty of new appliances and features by BasementRemodeling.com','Basement finishing and remodeling Washington DC, basement renovation Washington DC, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement contractor, finishing, remodeling, portfolio, wine storage, basement remodeling ideas, basement remodeling projects