onitors allows you to keep track of the latest sports trends with ease.</p>',0,131,'2020-09-22 18:49:17'),(183,'Basement Remodel with a Built In Wardrobe','In Arlington, VA, this basement remodel features LVT flooring, recessed ceiling with hidden LED lights unite to form a one-of-a-kind family room. A flashy wardrobe has a vintage-themed sink, LVT flooring, overhead vanity lamps, and plenty of room for clothing! The full bathroom includes tiled shower with sliding glass doors, and tile flooring.','Basement finishing and remodeling Arlington VA, basement renovation Arlington Virginia, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company.','basement-remodeling-arlington-va-13-10','Basement Remodel with a Built In Wardrobe','','4317 24th St N Arlington, VA 22207','38.9024472','-77.11602119999999',1,880,1162,'<p>In Arlington, VA, there&rsquo;s one basement project in particular that&rsquo;s bold,&nbsp;inviting,&nbsp;and anything but ordinary! Bright colors, LVT flooring, an extra thin column, and a recessed ceiling with hidden LED lights unite to form a one-of-a-kind family room that has unforgettable character and loads of charm. A flashy wardrobe features a vintage-themed washing station (sink), LVT flooring, overhead vanity lamps, and, of course, plenty of room for clothing! The full bathroom includes tiled shower with sliding glass doors, matching tiled accent wall, and matching tiled floor &ndash; not to mention a beautiful built-in dresser complete with towel rack and supreme glass-plated shelving.</p>',0,132,'2020-09-22 18:51:00'),(184,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project, Hanover, MD | Basement Masters','This Hanover, MD basement remodel features tile flooring for the family room which has a full-size wet bar with a sink and wraparound black marble countertops. A full bathroom contains a tiled shower with tiled seat and frameless glass door. The guest closet has been converted into a laundry room with washer and dryer.','Basement finishing and remodeling Ha