cludes a single decorative column, which offers a simple but effective template for strategically placing furniture, rugs, decorations, shelving, or an entertainment center.</p>',0,134,'2020-09-22 19:07:42'),(186,'Modern Minimalistic Basement Finishing','Fun and perky minimalist finished basement in Adamstown, Maryland. Basement Remodeling Company portfolio.','basement finishing project, Adamstown, MD, remodeling projects, portfolio','basement-finishing-remodeling-adamstown-md-19-04-19','Modern Minimalistic Basement Finishing','','5891 Union Ridge Drive, Adamstown, MD 21710','39.30831970000001','-77.4666343',1,1200,1196,'<p>Elements of modern minimalism converge to create a fun and perky finished basement project in Adamstown, Maryland. A classy blend of natural light, wall lamps and hidden LED lighting makes darker furnishings pop against beige carpeting and a neutral color scheme in the family room. A delightful corner nook boasts soft furniture with round edges giving way to stylish center-opening barn doors. A decorative half-wall with column and LVT flooring designates the entranceway to a full-sized wet bar with wine storage, custom cabinets and modern appliances. White baseboard molding creates depth and symmetry throughout.</p>\n<p>Light colors on white door trim with LVT flooring enlarges the half-bathroom, which features a vanity sink, overhead lighting and extra-tall luxury faucet. A similar design choice opens up a second full-size bathroom that has a shower enclosure, hopper window, and double vanity sinks with luxury faucets under dual mirrors and overhead lighting.</p>\n<p>Featured in: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/frederick/adamstown\">Basement Finishing in Adamstown</a></p>',0,50,'2020-09-22 19:09:54'),(187,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #7','This Ellicott City, MD basement remodel features row lighting, decorative columns and a bulkhead. The family room has an entertainment area and the kids’ playroom behind. The music roo