tub enclosure with retractable shower wand.</p>',0,166,'2020-09-22 20:41:41'),(227,'Basement Remodel - Kids Playroom and Decorative Columns','A basement remodel in Severna Park, MD features a ceiling with recessed lighting, decorative columns, a beautifully designed kids playroom under the stairs, and much more.','Basement finishing and remodeling Severna Park MD, basement renovation Severna Park Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement design ideas, portfolio, basement contractor','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-severna-park-14-03','Basement Remodel - Kids Playroom and Decorative Columns','Severna Park, MD','474 Yorkshire rd, Severna park, md,21146','39.092426','-76.58325099999999',1,800,1623,'<p>A basement project in Severna Park, MD serves as the ultimate multi-purpose room for friends and family. The walls are sugar cookie tan with powder white trim, complemented by a matching ceiling with beautiful recessed lighting. A triple set of decorative columns sectionalizes the space into individual areas &ndash; and check out the delightful kid&rsquo;s playroom under the stairs with stenciled mock house entrance! The deluxe sound system with wall-mounted speakers transforms this area into the perfect place for hosting large parties or simply relaxing by yourself. The full bathroom includes shower enclosure, tiled&nbsp;flooring&nbsp;and modern architecture. The possibilities are intriguing and endless!</p>\n<p>Featured in: <a href=\"../../../basement-finishing-area/md/anne-arundel/severna-park\">Basement Remodeling in Severna Park</a></p>',0,167,'2020-09-22 20:43:24'),(228,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Fulton, MD','This basement remodeling project in Fulton, MD features a movie room with built-in shelving and recessed ceiling to hold a deluxe sound system.','Basement finishing and remodeling Fulton MD, basement renovation Fulton Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling