nd a full bathroom with vanity sink, overhead lighting, tiled flooring and tub shower enclosure by Kohler. In the main area, a wraparound sectional sofa in the family room receives ample natural light from multiple basement slider windows perfectly positioned so as not to cast any glare on the wall-mounted HDTV. Tasteful, low-pile grey carpet contrasts nicely against white baseboard molding.</p>',0,172,'2020-09-22 20:54:19'),(237,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Highland, MD','This basement remodel project in Highland, MD has a family room, decorative columns, and a jet-black wood burning stove which sits atop a patch of decorative tiling.','Basement finishing and remodeling Highland MD, basement renovation Highland Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-highland-md-16-01','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Highland, MD','7421 Bucks Haven Ln, Highland, MD 20777','39.1669611','-76.94875499999999',1,1230,1716,'<p>This basement project in Highland, MD is bright and cheerful, featuring a uniform cream appearance with sharp angles and modern columns to give unparalleled depth and visual symmetry. The family room is wide open and has a wall-mounted HDTV, angled downwards, and a masculine entertainment cabinet directly beneath; egress windows let in plenty of natural light. The jet black wood burning stove provides warmth during the cold winter&nbsp;months,&nbsp;and sits handsomely atop a patch of decorative tiling. Check out the under stairs closet, perfect for extra stowaway space. A lime green half bathroom with ceramic tiles, clean lines, and vanity lamps accentuates a pleasing modern finish.</p>',0,174,'2020-09-22 21:01:25'),(238,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #','This Ellicott City, MD basement remodeling project features a family room with recessed ceiling and LVT flooring, a cozy wet bar with dark overhead cabinetr