 cheery basement project in Columbia, MD will satisfy your everyday needs in style. An abundance of shelving in the family room provides extra storage space while looking fun and&nbsp;fashionably&nbsp;&ndash; the shelving&rsquo;s dark finish contrasts beautifully against the buttermilk walls with white trim, decorative column, and blush accent wall. A quaint office offers a quiet and secluded area to peacefully tend to important paperwork and other business. The full bathroom with shower enclosure has sliding doors and closet, and the architecture creates complex dimensional depth that will please guests with each and every stay.</p>',0,163,'2020-09-22 21:05:23'),(240,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project #2 - Odenton, MD','This Odenton, MD basement remodeling project features a family room with a bar counter and a small kitchenette, and a kids’ playroom under the stairs with a kid-sized entranceway and mini-window cutout.','Basement finishing and remodeling Odenton MD, basement renovation Odenton Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-odenton-md-16-03','Basement Finishing / Remodeling, Project #2','Odenton, MD','2315 Station House Ln, Odenton, MD 21113','39.0557163','-76.7004439',1,900,1741,'<p>This Odenton, MD basement project has a unique style and flavor all of its own that takes advantage of every nook and cranny while creating layers of modern architectural delight. A light-colored family room with&nbsp;mulberry&nbsp;accent wall and TV preparations&nbsp;is&nbsp;complimented by a countertop with ample surface space and elevated privacy window; a small kitchenette fits snugly in the nearby corner with enough space for cabinets, marble countertop, and a modern stainless steel appliance. The under stairs kids&rsquo; playroom contains a kid-sized entranceway and mini-window cutout. The tawny bedroom is equipped with a new egress window that extends to the outside yard, an open space enclosed in glass that&rsquo;s perfect for indoor gardening! The full lemon yellow bathroom with shower enclosure, sliding doors, ceramic tiled floor and luxury countertop completes this unbeatable basement design.</p>',0,176,'2020-09-22 21:07:40'),(242,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Brandywine, MD','This Brandywine, MD basement remodel project includes a single walk-out, new egress window, full kitchen with wraparound counters, cabinets, tiled floor, and a deluxe stovetop oven, a gym room, and full bathroom.','Basement finishing and remodeling Brandywine MD, basement renovation Brandywine Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-brandywine-md-16-01','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Brandywine, MD','12003 Wardell way, Brandywine, MD 20613','38.7252351','-76.8741905',1,1300,1765,'<p>This upbeat and perky Brandywine, MD basement project is the perfect downstairs addition to any home. A single walk-out with an all-white finish offers easy access to the bedroom from the outside, and a new egress window lets the&nbsp;sun shine&nbsp;in beautifully. The full kitchen includes wraparound counters and cabinets, a full refrigerator unit, tiled floor, and a deluxe stovetop oven with an overhead state-of-the-art ventilator. The gym room with red carpet, column, and elevated privacy windows gives a clean space to perform your favorite workout routines. The design is completed by a full bathroom with shower enclosure, ceramic&nbsp;sink&nbsp;and a light blue motif.</p>',0,162,'2020-09-22 21:11:00'),(243,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Annandale, VA','This stunning basement project takes great advantage of the sunny weather and fresh air in Annadale, VA.','basement remodeling, basement renovation, basement project, general contractor, basement finishing, Annandale, VA, portfolio','basement-finishing-remodeling-annandale-virginia','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Annandale, VA','7117 Lanier st, Annandale, VA 22003','38.8274115','-77.1918519',1,440,1768,'<p>This stunning basement project takes great advantage of the sunny weather and fresh air in Annadale, VA. French doors and mulled double windows combine to let plenty of natural light sweep into the home, while tasteful recessed lighting makes the white trim pop against blue and lavender walls. LVT flooring and high quality carpet work together to separate the rooms nicely while creating additional depth. A simple decorative door now divides the basement into two wide open areas that would make for excellent family rooms, kids\' rooms, guest bedrooms, and more. The bathroom is equipped with a beautiful tiled shower with retractable stainless washing wand and curb, and a soothing Robin\'s Egg Blue color scheme.</p>',0,178,'2020-09-22 21:13:03'),(245,'Basement Redesign - Kitchen, Carpet, and Recessed Lighting','A clean design full of viable space is the theme for this beautiful basement project in Fairfax, Virginia.','basement remodeling, basement renovation, basement project, general contractor, basement finishing, Fairfax, VA, portfolio','basement-finishing-remodeling-fairfax-virginia-2','Basement Redesign - Kitchen, Carpet, and Recessed Lighting','','4711 Briar Patch Ln, Fairfax, VA 22032','38.8207965','-77.2660853',1,600,1791,'<p>A clean design full of viable space is the theme for this beautiful basement project in Fairfax, Virginia. Down a beautiful staircase with dual half-walls and banister grips lies a wide open olive family room with a glass double door entrance and recessed lighting. Single hung windows with sills lets in even more natural light, and the closet has wire storage racks and hi-speed router ports. A light-colored adjacent room mixes style with utility by combining a washer and dryer room with a kitchen-like wet bar complete with LVT flooring, stainless steel appliances, and overhead cabinetry. Finally, a beautiful half-bathroom uses mosaic tiling for the floors to create a distinguished interior d&eacute;cor which compliments the light grey scheme nicely.</p>',0,179,'2020-09-22 21:16:43'),(246,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project - Clarksville, MD','This clean and sophisticated basement in Clarksville, MD exemplifies how well-placed decorative columns can help direct the energy and flow of a wide open area.','basement remodeling, basement renovation, basement project, general contractor, basement finishing, Clarksville, MD, portfolio','basement-finishing-remodeling-clarksville-md','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','Clarksville, MD','7298 Meadow Wood Way, Clarksville, MD, 21029','39.179535','-76.91913269999999',1,1500,1804,'<p>This clean and sophisticated basement project in Clarksville, MD exemplifies how well-placed decorative columns can help direct the energy and flow of a wide open area. High awning windows with deep sills helps to capture natural light, while sparse rows of recessed lighting help to maintain a bright and cheery atmosphere. The carpeted stairs with half-wall now also has understairs storage to free up even more space in a basement that is quite spacious as it is. Tasteful pinefrost green wall extend throughout the premises, leading into a luxurious bathroom with dual vanity lights, black cabinets, and Kohler shower enclosure.</p>',0,180,'2020-09-22 21:18:43'),(252,'Basement Finishing / Remodeling Project','This basement remodel project in Timonium, MD includes a big family room with entrance sliding doors and carpet flooring and a full bathroom with sliding-door shower enclosure and tiled floor.','Basement finishing and remodeling Timonium MD, basement renovation Timonium Maryland, finishing basement contractor and remodeling company, basement finishing, basement remodeling, basement contractor, portfolio','basement-finishing-and-remodeling-timonium-md-12-08','Basement Finishing / Remodeling','','12 L