t remodel Virginia, basement remodeling services DC, Vienna basement design, basement finishing Maryland','basement-remodel-with-gourmet-kitchen-wine-cellar-and-sauna-in-vienna-va','Luxurious Basement Remodel in Vienna, VA – Custom Wine Cellar, Sauna, and Gourmet Kitchen','Vienna, VA','2107 Polo Pointe Drive, Vienna, VA, 22181','38.9234604','-77.31472839999999',1,1234,3792,'<p>This basement remodel in Vienna, VA, redefines elegance and functionality, creating a multi-purpose space perfect for entertaining, relaxation, and everyday convenience.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Gourmet Kitchen:</strong> Featuring a stunning marble waterfall island, custom cabinetry, and gold-accented pendant lighting, this kitchen brings a touch of luxury to basement living. It&rsquo;s the perfect blend of style and utility for hosting gatherings or casual family meals.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Glass-Enclosed Wine Cellar:</strong> A sleek, modern wine cellar with floor-to-ceiling glass walls and custom shelving provides both practicality and a striking design element for wine enthusiasts.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Relaxing Sauna:</strong> The wood-paneled sauna offers a tranquil retreat, perfect for unwinding after a long day. Its thoughtful design and attention to detail elevate the spa-like experience.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Custom Walk-In Shower:</strong> The contemporary shower features elegant tile work and high-end fixtures, adding a practical yet stylish touch to the space.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This project is a testament to the craftsmanship and vision of our team, turning an underutilized basement into a luxurious retreat. Designed to meet the needs of our clients, it reflects the highest standards of quality and attention to detail.</p>',0,3,'2025-01-02 21:50:00'),(345,'Basement Remodel with Wet Bar and Home Gym in Falls Church, VA','Explore this beautifully remodeled basement in Falls Church, VA, featuring a custom wet bar with sleek cabinetry, a functional home gym with a glass door, and a spacious open area for entertainment. This project combines modern design and practical use, showcasing our expert craftsmanship.','basement remodel Falls Church VA, wet bar design Virginia, home gym remodel DC, basement renovation Falls Church, modern basement renovation Maryland, luxury basement remodel VA, custom basement design DC, Falls Church basement contractor','basement-remodel-wet-bar-home-gym-in-falls-church-va','Basement Remodel with Wet Bar and Home Gym','Falls Church, VA','42661 Lobelia Place, Chantilly, , VA, 20152','38.8784958','-77.528115',1,786,3798,'<p>This stunning basement remodel in Falls Church, VA, offers the perfect balance of style and functionality. Key features include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Custom Wet Bar:</strong> Designed with dark cabinetry, open shelving, and a sleek countertop, this wet bar is both stylish and practical, ideal for entertaining guests.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Home Gym:</strong> Enclosed with a glass door for a modern touch, this gym area provides a dedicated space for workouts without compromising the overall aesthetic.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Spacious Open Area:</strong> The open layout is perfect for lounging, entertaining, or creating a multipurpose space for the family.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Modern Bathroom:</strong> A beautifully finished bathroom with a walk-in shower, marble tile, and a sleek vanity adds both convenience and luxury.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This basement remodel exemplifies modern design and thoughtful construction, turning an underutilized space into a versatile and inviting retreat.</p>',0,183,'2025-01-07 17:34:25'),(346,'Modern Basement Remodel with Wet Bar, Fireplace, and Home Gym in Bethesda, MD','This modern basement remodel in Bethesda, MD, combines elegance and functionality. Featuring a custom wet bar with open shelving, a cozy lounge area with a sleek fireplace, a dedicated home gym, and a modern bathroom, this space is perfect for entertaining and relaxation.','Basement remodel Bethesda MD, modern wet bar design MD, home gym renovation Maryland, custom fireplace design Bethesda, luxury basement remodel DC, modern basement design Maryland, basement finishing Bethesda MD, basement finishing DC area','modern-basement-remodel-with-wet-bar-and-gym-in-bethesda-md','Modern Basement Remodel with Wet Bar, Fireplace, and Gym','Bethesda, MD','6510 79th Pl, Cabin john, MD, 20818','38.97581419999999','-77.164025',1,1255,0,'<p>This beautifully remodeled basement in Bethesda, MD, showcases a seamless blend of modern design and practicality.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Custom Wet Bar:</strong> Featuring sleek cabinetry, open shelving, and gold accents, the wet bar is perfect for entertaining guests.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Lounge Area:</strong> A cozy seating area with a modern fireplace serves as a welcoming space for relaxation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Home Gym:</strong> A dedicated workout area with a clean, minimalist design ensures function without compromising style.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Modern Bathroom:</strong> The bathroom boasts a unique hexagonal tile backsplash, a floating vanity, and a frameless glass shower for a contemporary feel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This basement transformation is designed to cater to both leisure and entertainment, making it a standout addition to any home.</p>',1,184,'2025-01-07 17:48:55');
