oney to most. \n\nWe pride ourselves on lending money to business owners fast and when they need it.\n\nOur lending requirements are simple:\nIn Business for at least 6 months\nBusiness Checking Account\n450+ FICO score\nNeed 3 Business Deposits Monthly in Checking\nCurrently Generating at Least $5,000 per month minimum\n\nWe fund from $10,000-$1million\n• No Collateral Needed\n• Only do a soft credit pull (unless score under 650)\n• Offers to consider within 8 hrs. \nIn fact, we’re the first to launch an instant approval and same day business funding up to $25k.\n• 1-3 business days for over $25k-$1 mil\n• 10 minute application process\n• Rates range from 1.4% -1.9%\n\nWe will approve 100%-200% of your monthly revenue. This is called Revenue Based Funding for growth and expansion.\n\nCheck out our website: 911FundingCapital.com for the top level services we provide.\n\n\"When Your Bank Can\'t Help - We Can!\"\n\nAfter you submit your details, we\'ll respond promptly with the best offers we have available.\n\nI will follow up with a call. You can also reach me, Jonathan at 757-585-9799.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-08-10 13:30:33'),(93,'Francis','Bidinger','golfinmb@yahoo.com','3016063453','21754',NULL,'Is it legal to build an enclosed room in a condo garage with no window and no permit?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-08-10 14:50:21'),(94,'Linda','Hopkins','lindahopkinsmkt@gmail.com','4101231234','10032',NULL,'Hi,\nI just visited your website and I was wondering if you would like to see my vision of what I would suggest for your website. I would love the opportunity to show you our work. No commitment for future work, fine print or hidden anything- just an opportunity for you to see what some of our sites look like.\n\nI\'ll be happy to show you some of our work in your industry to give you some ideas. You\'ll then get to see one way in which your site might be redesigned to cater to the customers of today. That\'s it! Would that be ok to send? Thanks in advance!\n\nWarm 