u estimate the material needed for a project. \n\nHere is the Embassy Ceilings website if you wish to have more information, see pictures & more. :	 https://www.embassyceiling.com/ \n\nHere is the Embassy Ceilings Installation video : 	\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2AViedXTH30&t=2s \n\nHere is the WAYFAIR LINK where our product is available in the USA : \nhttps://www.wayfair.com/home-improvement/pdp/embassy-ceilings-80-sq-ft-suspended-ceiling-tile-and-grid-kit-ebad1001.html \n\nDon’t hesitate should you have any questions. Have a great rest of your day!\n\nBest regards,\n\nAlexis Marois\nManufacturing Agent \namarois@embassyinc.ca ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-10-21 11:53:28'),(119,'Javier','Myles','javier.swiftestimating@gmail.com','4702847295','30047',NULL,'Hi Sir/Madam,\n \nI hope that you are doing well. It is to convey you that we provide services for Cost Estimation and Quantity Take-off with 98% accuracy and refund policy. Please let us know if you need any sort of estimation services regarding your projects. The quantities we provide are software based, therefore, it will be exact, accurate and the prices in our estimates are according to the area of the project (RS Means). Now, to increase the list of costumers, we offer 50% Discount on our services with no compromise on quality of work.\n \nAll you need to do is just to send over the drawings, pictures or a PDF file of your proposed project, we will be able to give you a Quotation on the subject. And if you agree, we will make a detailed estimate. Feel free to contact me if you have any query.\n \nKind Regards.\n \nJavier  Myles\nMarketing Lead\nOffice: (470)-284-7295\nwww.swiftestimating.com\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-10-22 16:08:39'),(120,'Amanda','Souza','sales@ravivacompany.com','2408400372','20850',NULL,'I’m Amanda Souza from Raviva Company. How are you today?\n\nI came to offer our home renovation services for your company. We work with kitchen, bathroom, living room, bedrooms, basement renovations, interior and exterior painting and home additions. Our team can take care of all the projects you want to outsource to us. We have a team of designers, sales, customer service and operations who will proudly work on behalf of your company and you won\'t have to worry about anything! We take care of everything.\n\nWe work with FineCraft Contractors, Remodel Washington DC, and Quick Countertop, which are also in the remodeling market.\nIf you\'re interested in getting to know us better, let us know when we can schedule a meeting.\nLooking forward to working with you!\n\nPhone Number: 2408400372\nE-mail: sales@ravivacompany.com\nWebsite: https://www.ravivacompany.com\n\nBest regards,\nAmanda Souza',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-10-24 14:37:00'),(121,'Diana','Garnica','dpgacevedo@icloud.com','2027103370','20011',NULL,'My name is Diana Garnica. My husband and I just got a Fixer-Upper Townhouse in DC [Total Finished 1,582 SqFt | Lot Size 2,286 SqFt | Above Grade Finished 1,152 SqFt | Unfinished Basement 576 SqFt] (closing date November 9th) and we are requesting itemized quotes (including everything needed like permits, installation, workmanship…) for the repairs stated in the Inspection report (https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yf9A9eF8J1W1SZO1VdwE_MM_le9acU3d/view?usp=sharing ) linked in this message ,\n\nAll the above, thinking on the future to have:\nHVAC system (heating and cooling)\nGuest suite in basement with full bathroom\nWasher/Dryer unit room in basement\nUnder Stairs Powder Room in basement\nFurnace/mechanical room in basement\nOpen floor plan in first floor \nKitchen Renovation with modern appliances (e.g. Range hood, fridge, cooktop, dishwasher, wall microwave/oven)\nPowder Room\nUsing the attic space as an extension of the property\n\nPlease let us know if you have any question.\n\nThank you,\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-10-25 22:45:44'),(122,'Keleigh','Cox','kcyelverton@gmail.com','9106220769','20735',NULL,'Do you renovate garages? The garage is 1507.45 sqft. I want a quote to fix and paint the ceiling, add drywall and insulation to the cinderblock walls, and fix 2 windows that are not set correctly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-10-26 17:22:32'),(123,'Bin','Liu','bin.liu890@gmail.com','2408889439','21090',NULL,'We distribute Vinyl Flooring that are perfect for basements. Stocked in Baltimore, MD with job site deliveries available. Please let me know how we can get samples into your showroom. Thanks! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-10-27 09:39:20'),(124,'Brian','Broadwater','kefla_111@hotmail.com','7066690489','20715',NULL,'Curious if you remodel the drywall in garages? Quote for repairing sections and quote for total re-drywall.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-10-28 15:00:45'),(125,'Aaron','Lee','aaron.estimationservice@gmail.com','9292144999','12207',NULL,'We have a staff of certified estimators who provide a reliable building cost estimate. We are extremely accurate and efficient in helping building professionals determine the cost of building. The estimates and takeoffs are detailed, accurate, and inexpensive.\nOur estimates are fully modifiable giving you the control to add/change according to your requirements.\n\nPlease let me know if there is any method to have a business with you or send us your plans to know the quote shortly.\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-11-02 15:47:38'),(126,'Mike Sanchez','Mike Sanchez','aiecommercesolutions@gmail.com','7432390430','98888',NULL,'Hello There, My name is Mike Sanchez, Sales Director with FOX News. I was reaching out to see if you would be interested in advertising on LIVE TV with FOX News.\n\nBy advertising with us, your ad would reach over 10 MILLION Unique Viewers. Your business could generate more sales, leads, and appointments by as much as 50%.\n\nWe have seen some companies hit 100k in sales in just one week of launching their AD with FOX news\n\nOur pricing is 5,750 USD for a 30 second TV AD which runs for 30 Days. \n\nI guarantee you will get exposed to new customers and see a