r about a 10’ x 6.5’ l shape wet bar. Does your company not take on smaller projects?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-01-26 17:44:18'),(139,'Erica','Francis','efrancis@readyjob.org','3236424604','27518',NULL,'Hi,  \n\nWish you a wonderful day!   \n\nI\'m writing to see if you\'d be interested in my article. It\'ll provide invaluable insight on how best to transform an investment property for maximum return-on-investment. When it\'s completed, would your website like the piece?  Your readers will love this valuable information!  \n\nThank you, \nErica Francis of ReadyJob.org  \n\nP.S. If, by any chance, you’d prefer an article on a different topic, please send over your suggestions. However, if you\'d prefer not to receive emails from me, please let me know!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-01-27 05:59:20'),(140,'Nicholas','Lemmer','nick.lemmer18@gmail.com','4105707083','21771',NULL,'Online quote didn\'t work. Can I get a quote to finish a 12\'x12\' room. 2 walls need framing. Want all 4 walls finished as well as ceiling. Flooring and painting is not needed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-02-01 19:56:21'),(141,'Chris','Lackovic','clack@acehandymanservices.com','4454440180','20112',NULL,'I assume my customer needs a building permit to replace a damaged exterior door header. What are approved materials for the header? There is not enough room for 2x10 boards...not a bearing wall.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-02-09 17:54:07'),(142,'Jorge','Puente','Jorge.Puente@Siemens.com','2408147145','20705',NULL,'Good morning,\n\n\nI\'m trying to use the link on your page to access the other page to help get an estimate on the cost of our permit but it\'s saying that the page doesn\'t exist. Is there another site I can use to get the estimated cost of the permit? Thanks!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-02-10 13:21:18'),(143,'Tech','Sales','techsales@tuta.io','3019709091','21214',NULL,'Have a single family property in Baltimore Hamilton area, zip 21214. Need a quote for fencing backyard, sprucing up outdo