blefinancing.net\n\nRespond with stop to optout.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-03-23 15:51:23'),(153,'Jennifer','Wesley','jenniferwesleyseo@gmail.com','2073325614','04043',NULL,'Hi,\n\nI am a freelance website designer. I happened to come across your website and I’m wondering if it might be ok for me to email you a new website design/mock-up I have in mind for your company.\n\nNo commitment for future work, fine print, or hidden anything - just an opportunity for you to see how an updated version of your website might look.\n\nIf (and only if) you choose to have me develop it into a fully functional website, the price is just $2,500.00 which you can divide into five payments of $500.00 each. Hosting is just $49.00 per month or $395.00 per year.\nThat’s it!\n\nWould it be ok to send you the free design I have in mind?\nPlease let me know.\nThe designs take me about a week to make- again, they are completely free.\n\nThank you in advance!\nJennifer Wesley',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-03-24 12:39:46'),(154,'Bruce','Adderley','adderleyconstructioninc@gmail.com','3022752515','19804',NULL,'Bruce Adderley\n1302 West Newport Pike \nWilmigton,De 19804\n@adderleyconsturctioninc@gmail.com\nCell-302-275-2515\nFax-302-994-9267\n\nBruce Adderley we are a \nSubcontractor looking for work \nWe specialize in Grading,\n& excavation all type of pipe work\nTriaxle dump trucks for hauling material in and off sites \nFamily owned & operated since 2007\nLicenced & Fully Insured all operators \nhave 20 plus years experience\nThank You \nBruce Adderley\n1302 West Newport Pike\nbrucedozer@comcast.net\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-03-25 18:07:00'),(155,'Ali','Marco','Alm5423@gmail.com','5713348244','20148',NULL,'I was wondering if you could provide a generic price quote for the following services:\n\n1. Creating a brand new storage closet under an existing staircase. \n2. Creating built in shelves for an entertainment unit would be 11.5 ft wide by 9 ft tall. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-03-27 21:15: