 Winchester Ct Westminster MD 21057. They have photos online as well as the listed square footage of the basement, 780 sqft. We would like to help with lowering the cost by not finishing part of the basement so we can use some of it as a home-gym as well as a space for utilities. We would also be willing to save on costs where applicable like purchasing supplies (vanity, flooring, etc) where you see fit, completing the painting on our own, and utilizing more basic materials for the bathroom. Please let me know if you would be able to provide me with an estimated cost of this project as this will determine how quickly we can complete the project depending on your backlog. If you could email me at your earliest convenience it would be greatly appreciated! Thank you so much for your help and have a wonderful day!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-04-21 14:44:39'),(167,'Erica','Sterling ','Esterling625@gmail.com','2408883053','20721',NULL,'Interested in getting an estimate to repair/sure up our interior stairs. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-04-24 18:15:00'),(168,'John','Natale','jnatale@gofinme.com','4439090692','21401',NULL,'We are the oldest flooring company in Annapolis introducing ourselves to fellow businesses.  I reached out to see if perhaps we could help with any commercial or residential flooring needs that you may have.  \n\nWe would like the opportunity to be part of the bidding process, turn work, common area work, and new construction.  My direct number is 443-909-0692.\n\nThe link to our website is below.  Feel free to check us out and see if there is anything we can help with.\n\nRegards,\n\n--\nJohn Natale\nBusiness Development Manager\nFinme Flooring\nMHIC # 141466\n443-909-0692\n\nwww.gofinme.com\nFacebook\nInstagram\nTikTok\nLinkedin\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-04-28 14:31:48'),(169,'Jose','Díaz S.','Expressaaremodelingllc@gmail.com','4433370641','21236',NULL,'Hello good morning; I wanted to put myself at your disposal. I have my remodeling company and licens