rvices.  Are you available to receive a quote for your facility janitorial needs?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-24 20:30:15'),(187,'lamont','nelson','19Ballou73@gmail.com','3013257907','20607',NULL,'do i need building permit to frame interior basement walls',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-08-07 11:33:50'),(188,'Macon','Hughes','macon.hughes@gmail.com','7065367026','22302',NULL,'I\'m interested in adding a basement to my house. We currently don\'t have a basement, we have a crawlspace underneath our house so it would require excavation work. The size of the space would be approximately 850 square feet. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-08-08 15:16:09'),(189,'George','Montilla','admin@vanguardprorealty.com','3043059147','92008',NULL,'Hello Basement Finishing by BasementRemodeling.com, \n\nWe are reaching out because we\'d like to partner with you. We have a few spots available near you and we’re looking for a few dedicated painters like yourself that we can display to our clients. Learn more about partnering with us and getting free leads from our large network of active clients and realtors by viewing the link below, or you can contact admin@vanguardprorealty.com for more information: \n\nwww.vanguardprorealty.com/join-as-a-partner\n\n\nThank you for your time, we look forward to hearing back.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-08-10 12:28:06'),(190,'Chris','Lester','Christopher.f.lester@gmail.com ','4129776436','21798',NULL,'Looking to re-model our basement. It currently has a drop ceiling in which I would like to replace with drywall. \n\nThe basement has low ceilings. Is it possible to have a home theater or bar (Or both)?\n\nI can get exact height, but it is a bit under 8’\n\nThanks\n\nChris',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-08-13 23:16:18'),(191,'Cameron','Ward','cameron.ward@bizwealthbuilder.com','9194362319','27610',NULL,'Hi there,\n\nThe BRRRR (Buy, Rehab, Rent, Refinance, Repeat) investment strategy can be a great way to get into real estate investing, but finding the right property for this approach can be daunting, especially for beginners.\n\nThat\'s where I come in. I’d love the opportunity to share my tips and tricks for identifying the ideal property for a BRRRR investment and creating a plan for maximizing profits. By writing a guest blog post for your site, I hope to provide a useful starting point for anyone seeking financial independence through BRRRR.\n\nAll the best,\nCameron Ward\nFounder, BizWealthBuilder.com\n\n\nP.S. If you’re interested in receiving an article but have a different topic preference, that’s no problem! Please send your idea over, and we can move forward from there. However, if you don’t want me to contact you again, please let me know.\n\n\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-08-29 08:01:46'),(192,'Stacey','James','info@businesshonorlocal.com','8885099915','77018',NULL,'I\'m writing to you today on behalf of the Hyattsville Award Program. We\'re the organization that puts on the annual \"Best of Hyattsville Award\", and I\'m pleased to inform you that your company has been selected as the winner in the category of General contractor.\n\nI know we\'ve tried to reach you a few times before, but we\'ve finally been able to get in touch with you through your website contact form. We wanted to make sure you were aware of this exciting news as soon as possible.\n\nWe\'ve included a link to our website below that more fully describes your recognition. We hope you\'ll look at it and share it with your staff.\n\nhttps://hyattsville.businesshonorlocal.com/S2QKQQ9Y\n\nCongratulations again on this well-deserved honor!\n\nSincerely,\n\nStacey\n\nhttps://hyattsville.businesshonorlocal.com/s2qkqq9y_BASEMENT-FINISHING--BASEMENT-REMODE',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-09-05 02:37:22'),(193,'Rasel','Ali','rasel.ali@gmail.com','7038507392','20002',NULL,'Hello, I need an estimate for remodeling and building new rooms and a garage. Are you available this Saturday afternoon to give an estimate?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-09-05 23:53:19'),(194,'BRU