nt to be able to speak with you and talk further about how we can help you save in your business.\n\nIf you are open-minded, please let me know when is a good time and the best number to call you at.\n\nLooking forward to being of service!\n-\nBruce Silverman\nCEO\nTechnodream\n(702) 780-1633\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-09-08 06:58:08'),(195,'Eileen','Rosen','eileenrosenus@gmail.com','4012012012','10032',NULL,'Hey\nI would like to offer some suggestions for your website. No commitment for future work, fine print, or hidden anything - just an opportunity for you to see how we can improve your website and leads.\n\nWould it be ok to send you the suggestions I have in mind?\n\nPlease let me know.\nRegards,\nEileen Rosen',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-09-12 10:39:59'),(196,'Thomas','Keller','yards5@yahoo.com','7176883200','21253',NULL,'just making sure that I\'m interpreting the map correctly, you guys do not come to the Hereford area, we are in Freeland right off 83 above Cockeysville  Thanks Tom Keller',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-09-13 15:16:33'),(197,'Henry ','Myers','evilhenny2000@yahoo.com','4199360624','20009',NULL,'My apologizes, \n\nhttps://washingtondc.craigslist.org/doc/egr/d/hyattsville-kitchen-and-bath-interior/7663838192.html\n\n\nIs this real?\n\nSometimes recruiters and consultants  post fake help wanted ads.\n\nThanks\nHenry',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-09-16 15:55:16'),(198,'Portia','Lee','portia@lcompanyltd.net','4156344118','10555',NULL,'Have you had bad experiences with recruitment agencies in the past that did not understand your specific needs and failed to deliver the results you were looking for? L & Company Ltd. takes the time to understand your company\'s needs and culture, as well as the specific requirements of each role you are looking to fill. Our commitment to providing exceptional recruitment services comes with a guarantee. We guarantee all non-executive candidates for up to 15 months, and executive-level placements are guaranteed for 2 years.