les support\n·         Issue resolution\n·         CRM / Database management\n·         Calendar management\n·         Social media reputation management \n \nØ  Business-to-business and Business-to-consumer telemarketing  \n·         Outbound Appointment setting (personal visit appointment and phone appointment)\n·         Survey / Prequalification calls\n·         Inbound and outbound telemarketing calls\n·         Inbound and outbound telemarketing emails\n·         Document transactions\n·         Maintain database by data and lead verification\n \nØ  Virtual assistant or Virtual team  \nØ  Data Gathering, Data Cleaning, Data Research\n \nWould really want to be able to speak with you and talk further about how we can help you save in your business.\n\nIf you are open-minded, please let me know when is a good time and the best number to call you at.\n\nLooking forward to being of service!\n-\nBruce Silverman\nCEO\nTechnodream\n(702) 780-1633\n\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-10-05 07:05:43'),(204,'James','Bean','beanhousehold9@gmail.com','7034025759','22039',NULL,'Good morning. Some neighbors on our community page recommended your services. We are considering finishing our basement at some point. We are currently looking for design plans / layouts and pricing for the work. We are not ready to move forward yet with the job and are purely interested in design plans and pricing for finishing. If we ultimately decide to move forward with the work, it may be in stages rather than one job at one to spreads costs out over time. Thanks!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-10-16 13:17:16'),(205,'Buddy','Johnikin','Buddy@Cemrolloffs.com','4436398069','21704',NULL,'Hello,\n \nI want to introduce CEM Rolloffs to you and provide you with quotes for your sites around the DMV metropolitan area. CEM Rolloffs is a dynamic and growing company in the waste management industry. Our team has decades of experience managing roll-off containers and coordinating waste disposal services for some of the largest homebuilders, general contractors, demolition & construction companies in the DMV. CEM has yards in both Southern and Northern Maryland. CEM is positioned to efficiently service any sites around the DMV area. Please take a moment and visit our website for more information.\n \nwww.cemrolloffs.com \n \nPlease let us know how we can provide dumpster quotes to your team. We are committed to reliability, great customer service and competitive pricing. We go above and beyond to ensure customer satisfaction, from pricing to scheduling. Please choose us for a hassle-free experience. We are looking forward to partnering with you.      ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-10-21 00:08:46'),(206,'Jason','Mitchell','jason@cleaning-maryland.com','3019234018','20707',NULL,'I\'m in your area and would be happy to visit your business and submit a bid for your recurring weekly (or more) janitorial and disinfection needs. Would you like to compare pricing on your office cleaning service, or having your space cleaned addressing your cleaning issues i.e. communication, shoddy work, etc.? I\'d be happy to send you a no-obligation quote on your facilities cleaning. Please simply respond to this email and I’ll send the next steps.\n\nThanks,\n\nJason Mitchell\nPresident\nCommercial Cleanrs Maryland\njason@cleaning-maryland.com\n\n“Very professional and a pleasure to work with. I have six facilities and he was able to get out to everyone one with a quick turnaround. They went above and beyond to satisfy us.” —Bradley S.\n\nRespond with stop to optout.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-10-27 19:22:18'),(207,'Bryan','Eccleston','bde81783@gmail.com','2404010970','21774',NULL,'I have an unfinished basement with rough in plumbing for a bathroom. Do you do partial builds? For example if I just wanted to have the bathroom done and maybe some of the framing done at this time would I be able to do that or do you only do it all at once?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-11-13 17:14:20'),(208,'Terry','English',