48',NULL,'1) Do you have experience remodeling older homes with a nonconforming basement?\n2) Do you have experience performing structural repairs (sistering joists) in basements according to structural engineer plans?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-01-14 03:56:29'),(214,'Jason','Mitchell','jason@cleaning-maryland.com','3019234018','20707',NULL,'Are you tired of inconsistent results and lackluster attention to detail from your cleaning provider? With our specialized expertise, we can help you achieve an immaculate space that reflects your professionalism. We understand that selecting the right cleaning partner is a crucial decision, which is why we would like to offer you a no-obligation quote. This will give you the opportunity to experience the quality and value we bring to businesses in your industry. May I give you more information?\n\nI appreciate your time,\n\nJason Mitchell\nPresident\nCommercial Cleanrs Maryland\njason@cleaning-maryland.com\n\n“Very professional and a pleasure to work with. I have six facilities and he was able to get out to everyone one with a quick turnaround. They went above and beyond to satisfy us.” —Bradley S.\n\nRespond with stop to optout.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-01-16 22:35:39'),(215,'Lake','Mark','lake.mark@bestaccessdoors.com','8004830823','10003',NULL,'Interested in a Collaboration Opportunities - \n\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-01-18 10:09:03'),(216,'Lake','Mark','lake.mark@bestaccessdoors.com','8004830823','10003',NULL,'Interested in a Collaboration Opportunities - \nHi\nMy name is Lake Mark from Best Access Doors Company \nI\'m inquiring if you are open to the following collaboration opportunities: Guest Post/Blog, Link Insertion, and Link Exchange.\nI recently came	across your blog basementremodeling.com, and was impressed by the quality of the content. I would love to offer you an article that I believe your readers would definitely appreciate  \nI\'d like to know if you\'d be interested in featuring one of my articles on your blog. It will cover some of the finer informational aspects of \"High-Quality Doors, Home Improvements, DIY, Architecture, Construction, HVAC, Plumbing, and RV Homes.\"\nPlease check our website: https://www.bestaccessdoors.com/\nPlease check our website: https://www.accessdoorsandpanels.com/\n\nPlease let me know if you\'re interested in my offer. Additionally, could you please share your editorial guidelines or any requirements you may have for guest bloggers? \nI look forward to hearing from you.\nRegards\nLake Mark\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-01-18 10:09:15'),(217,'','','','','',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-01-21 02:59:10'),(218,'','','','','',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-01-21 02:59:33'),(219,'Noah','Leslie','noahleslie@gmail.com','5302202294','20007',NULL,'(the online quote forms wasn\'t submitting) We have a 500 sqft basement floor in Washington, DC that\'s really old. There are a few holes and it was covered by a rug that we\'ve removed. We\'re just looking for a simple re-coating so that we can walk on it while we work on a longer term remodel eventually. Is this something that you might do or be interested in? Wondering about a general quick quote, thanks!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-01-27 17:50:00'),(220,'Avi','Pratap','avi.digitaldot@gmail.com','8505832024','53040',NULL,'Hey,\n\nI am Avi, Business Development Manager at digitaldotagency.com which is a Website Design and Development Company.\n\nWe offer various services like Web designing, development, SEO and PPC. \n\n Just text me or call me or email me if you are looking for these services,\n\nLook forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest Regards,\nAvi',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-02-05 09:41:28'),(221,'Se-In','Son','sonsein0107@gmail.com','6073199461','20878',NULL,'Hi, my name is Se-In and my husband and I would like to renovate our basement which sqft is 1251. We would like to add a kitchen and a bathroom in the basement. Is getting a quote free of charge? How much approximately does it cost for renovation of 1251 sqft? Thank you! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-02-05 19:05:49'),(222,'Kaylee','Clark','kaylee@commercialcleanrsva.com','5712487637','22116',NULL,'We are local and provide exceptional janitorial services tailored to your specific needs. With superior cleaning standards, specialized services, and positive customer reviews, we take pride in partnering with many local businesses like yours. Would it be helpful to offer you a no-obligation professional cleaning quote?\n\nKaylee Clark\nBusiness Development\nCommercial Cleanrs Virginia\nkaylee@commercialcleanrsva.com\n\nRespond with stop to optout.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-02-15 21:28:23'),(223,'Randall','Martin','randall.martin@skyline-buildingservices.net','6128888872','94595',NULL,'Hi, Skyline Building Care is a local, top-quality cleaning company specializing in cleaning commercial facilities including churches, offices, schools, and medical buildings.\n\nWe can guarantee reliable janitors and a thoroughly cleaned facility at an affordable cost.\n\nIf you’re interested in a complimentary no-obligation quote, simply respond to this email and I’ll be in touch!\n\nProudly serving businesses in California and Washington DC.\n\n“You exceeded our expectations. Having worked 25 years in a service business, I appreciate professional people who know their job and perform it well. Thank you for the outstanding work!” —Jim, Fremont\n\n“We had serious problems with our previous cleaning company. Skyline immediately fixed the problems and I am pleased that they haven’t reoccurred.” —Bill, Walnut Creek\n\nBest,\nRandall\n\nRandall Martin\nSkyline Building Care\n(612) 888-8872\nrandall.martin@skyline-buildingservices.net\n\nPlease respond with \"STOP\" to opt out.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-02-18 11:54:40'),(224,'James','Gagnier','jmichaelgagnier@gmail.com','12407936838','20910',NULL,'Do you also do asbestos mitigation, which we will do before finishing the basement?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-02-19 21:25:49'),(2