hanks',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-04-29 15:14:42'),(235,'Melissa','Langston','seeyabye216@gmail.com','7038509108','20170',NULL,'I made a mistake and booked an appointment at 11am on May 14 and am unable to figure out how to cancel or change it. So I created a 2nd appointment for 11am on May 15. Please cancel the May 14. appointment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-05-04 23:18:31'),(236,'Bree','Mefford','bree@mefford.org','8017556129','84062',NULL,'I loved the Basement Bathroom in Bowie, MD that you had on your website.  Could you by chance tell me what the name of the blue tile is?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-05-06 15:05:16'),(237,'San','Lam','San.lam17@gmail.com','3012133699','20910',NULL,'Do you guys dig out / excavate basements? Or just remodel the space?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-05-07 00:51:54'),(238,'John','Severo','Jsevero@bestversionmedia.com','5716219409','22030',NULL,'Greetings!\n\n\nI want to thank you for taking the time to read this brief email, as it has some very important information for you. I am sending the information after having your email inquiry. \n\n\nMy name is John Severo. I live and work here in Fairfax, and am the publisher of the private monthly magazine that goes to the residents of Fairfax Station in our community. The magazine actually serves as a “Social Media Experience in Print” which is at the heart of what makes the magazine so unique, and I would love the opportunity to meet with you to show you what we offer as it is difficult, if not impossible, to do via email. The bottom line: if the residents of Fairfax Station would make good clients for you, then I think it would make perfect sense for us to meet for a few minutes, as our “micro-targeted” approach is the very best way to reach this audience on a monthly basis. Please take a few minutes to take a look at our website:\n\n\n\nhttps://www.bestversionmedia.com/?gclid=Cj0KCQjw6PGxBhCVARIsAIumnWYnIKSlm-7nANYLhnU5AansXKCTZyBBvSJ7m4707wvP42WCocHj-q4aAmJ6EALw_wcB \n\n\n\nI look forward to speaking with you soon so we can arrange a time to meet.\n\n\nBest regards,\n\nJohn S. Severo\nPublisher\nPhone: 571-621-9409\nwww.bestversionmedia.com\n\"Bringing People Together\"\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-05-13 19:29:59'),(239,'Zaida','Espada','zaida.espada@gmail.com','9176972711','20017',NULL,'Hello,\n\nI am looking to get a quote from you to make my basement (mother in law suite) DC compliant. We recently had a sump pump installed in the washer/dryer area of the basement.  The sump pump needed its own electrical outlet so we had a dedicated outlet installed just for sump pump.  DC inspected work today & we failed the inspection.  It seems the basement & the rest of the house need their own electrical panel & furnace. Everything needs to be separate.  Ceiling height might also be an issue., but may be ok if duct work is removed. We are also wondering if it would be easiest to put stairs connecting basement & the rest of the house to make it one home again.   Please let me know if we can schedule an appointment to assess & discuss.\n\nThank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-05-22 18:07:25'),(240,'','','','','',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-05-22 20:55:02'),(241,'','','','','',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-05-22 20:55:24'),(242,'Nicolas','Salomon','nicolassalomonmkts@gmail.com','2012012012','10032',NULL,'Hey\nI would like to offer some suggestions for your website. No commitment for future work, fine print, or hidden anything - just an opportunity for you to see how we can improve your website and leads.\n\nWould it be ok to send you the suggestions I have in mind?\n\nPlease let me know.\nNicolas Salomon',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-05-29 07:59:32'),(243,'Manuel ','McCoy ','Bigmrmc@gmail.com','7037746113','25438',NULL,'Hi, \nDo you do work in Jefferson County (Ranson), WV, adjacent to Loudoun County?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-05-30 01:45:55'),(244,'','','','','',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-05-31 07:35:44'),(245,'','','','','',NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-05-31 07:36:03'),(246,'Anders','Fernstrom','aefernstrom@gmail.com','3029834773','20147',NULL,'I have an unfinished basement room in a house I just purchased in Ashburn Farm. I’m thinking about converting it into a basement and I wonder if you could give me a rough estimate of the costs involved in installing an egress window. \n\nCurrently there is a single small window in the room, approximately 2 feet tall and about 6 feet from the floor. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-06-08 00:43:45'),(247,'Debbie','Doyle','nebra94@aol.com','9736155041','21131',NULL,'Hello! We just bought our first home and are struggling with the layout of our basement. I saw that you have design services. Is that something that you offer and at what rate? Would we be able to implement the plans ourselves?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-06-13 14:22:28'),(248,'Kaylee','Clark','kaylee@commercialcleanrsva.com','5712487637','22116',NULL,'I noticed your location the other day, and would love an opportunity to provide you with a cleaning quote. We’re working with several facilities in your area and everyone seems to love our work because of our reliability, responsiveness and attention to detail. May I give you more information and a no-obligation cleaning quote?\n\nKaylee Clark\nBusiness Development\nCommercial Cleanrs Virginia\nkaylee@commercialcleanrsva.com\n\nRespond with stop to optout.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-06-21 16:21:49'),(249,'Emilly','Miller','emilly.estimation@gmail.com','7866331764','13850',NULL,'Hi Sir,\nOur team specializes in comprehensive construction cost estimation services tailored to your needs. Currently, we are doing promotional marketing of our company and we will make you a bid winning estimate for $37 / trade. \n\nIf you are interested, do share us your plans.\n\n Save time and make informed decisions with our detailed reports Looking forward to hear from you. Thank you for your time. Have a nice day!\n\nBest regards,\nEmilly Miller | Marketing associate\nemilly.estimation@gmail.com\nEquinox Estimation\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-06-24 16:35:22'),(250,'Marsha','Pearcy','mpearcy@equinoxsearch.com','2028218113','20008',NULL,'Hi - we had a sewage backup in our basement and now are getting the broken pipe fixed.  We have to take out much of the dry wall - to make sure no mold has begun - I thought it might be a good time to do some updating since we may get Some insurance money - the flood was not all over the basement.  Old house in DC.  Thinking we can take advantage of the fact that the walls are going to have to be rebuilt anyway.  I tried to fill out the \"get a quote on line\" page, but it didn\'t work. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 21:55:27'),(251,'Judi','Moline','Molineja@gmail.com','3019725708','20876',NULL,'We are interested in having our old acoustic ceiling tiles replaced in the basement with a dropped ceiling.  Can you give me a quote?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 23:05:07'),(252,'Briar','Willette','training@learncodinganywhere.com','5032066915','97267',NULL,'Hello BasementRemodeling.com,\n\nI am with The Tech Academy. We are a technology school licensed to deliver tech certification training. We specialize in coding boot camps and custom training. Some of our past clients include Intuit, CarMax and the United States Air Force.\n\nWe offer in-person and online training, and I am writing to see if there is a need for training in any of the following areas:\n-Coding (Python, JavaScript, C#, Java)\n-Cloud Development\n-AI Development\n-Cybersecurity\n-Data Science (data analysis, data visualization, statistical analysis)\n-Mobile App development\n-Video game development\n-Project Management (Agile, Scrum, DevOps)\n\nWe have had success in not only upgrading the skills of those in technical positions, but also transitioning non-tech workers into tech roles. Basically, we can do beginner-level and advanced training. \n\nIf there is any potential here, you can book a time to speak with me through Calendly here: https://calendly.com/tech-academy-meeting/30min \n\nI look forward to speaking with you soon!\n\nBriar Willette, \nCorporate Training Introductions Manager\nThe Tech Academy\ntraining@learncodinganywhere.com\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 18:13:13'),(253,'Kyle','Morgan','kyleamorgan@gmail.com','8708821500','72211',NULL,'Hi, it looks like I\'m a little outside your service area for contracting work but would you guys be interested in a design/plan basement project?  I\'m located in Little Rock, AR and am finding it difficult to find someone locally that can effectively design a plan for my crawlspace (20 ft ceilings) into a finished basement.  I have pictures/measurements/full blown laser point cloud scan.  Would you guys be interested in quoting just the design/plans/boms? ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-28 11:41:35'),(254,'Kevin','Hart','kevinbhart1@gmail.com','9175703278','20854',NULL,'My family and I live in a 1970s home and are interested renovating the basement.   It is partially finished with a low ceiling.  Do you have ideas in maximizing space and updating the basement? ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-29 17:03:26'),(255,'Jose','Molto','josemolto85@gmail.com','2023788615','20007',NULL,'Hello!\n\nWe are interested in renovating our basement. We are wondering if the initial quote and consultation are free in case we don\'t want to proceed. \n\nThank you!\n\nJose',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-08 14:31:38'),(256,'Philkp','Yasinski','pyasinski@jreingold.com','2025502600','20015',NULL,'Schedule design build consultation ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-14 12:01:27'),(257,'Zach','Sullivan','zachs@framexlabinc.com','8149805065','08753',NULL,'Ready to elevate your business with a custom mobile app? At Frame X Lab, we specialize in crafting innovative and user-centric apps designed specifically to meet your unique needs.\n\nWhy choose us? Here’s what sets us apart:\n\nTailored Solutions: We create apps that fit your business perfectly.\nIntuitive Design: User-friendly interfaces that your customers will love.\nOn-Time Delivery: We stick to deadlines so you can hit your goals.\nContinuous Support: We’re here for you even after your app launches.\nSeize the chance to outshine your competitors and engage your audience like never before. Reach out today for a personalized consultation!\n\nIf you are interested in getting more information just respond back to this email.\n\nBest regards,\n\nZach Sullivan\nFrame X Lab\nzachs@framexlabinc.com\n\nRespond with stop to optout.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-16 21:09:32'),(258,'Conor','Patrick','conorpatrick207@gmail.com','2076595209','20814',NULL,'Hi,\n\nDo you offer service to construct a new basement for an existing home that doesn\'t have a basement yet?  If not who do you recommend?\n\nThanks,\nConor',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-20 20:04:40'),(259,'Zachary','George','Zacharygeorge6485@icloud.com','4065908484','22153',NULL,'Hello.  I was wondering if you guys were hiring. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 00:45:58'),(260,'Edwin','Kern','tregaul@gmail.com','2406834924','21776',NULL,'We\'re looking to remodel a garage into a 3room and 1 bathroom suite. Do you do this kind of work?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-09 17:47:53'),(261,'David','Benton','David@BentonArchitecture.com','2022131197','20782',NULL,'I am an architect working with clients on a basement renovation in Hyattsville, MD.  Do you work with architects? If so, I would like to discuss how to get preliminary pricing and possibly work together.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-18 17:44:28'),(262,'Tyler','Fischesser','fishboy1111@msn.com','8054778343','20886',NULL,'Do you guys do egress windows?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-19 12:24:23'),(263,'LUTHER','MONROE','lutherj131@aol.com','2023606179','20745',NULL,'On 16 Sep a Rep from you company came and measured my basement for finishing. I was told that he would provide me documentation of the cost to do the finishing. I have not received anything. Rep Name was ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-20 13:43:52'),(264,'FRANCISCO ','GONZALEZ','FRANCISCO679@HOTMAIL.COM','2404182556','21791',NULL,'To make stairs for a basement that I have never had and its door I need permission and if you do that project thanks',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-20 17:14:46'),(265,'Elizabeth','Marconi','elizabethmaureen15@gmail.com','4433701248','22205',NULL,'Hello, \n\nI hope this message finds you well! I am interested in remodeling my basement and would like to learn more about your services. I live in the Dominion Hills neighborhood in Arlington, VA. Our basement was originally renovated in the \'70s, and has a little bit of water damage along one wall.\n\nCould you please provide  information on your services, availability for a consultation, and pricing? If possible, I am also interested in seeing some examples of your previous work. \n\nThank you for your assistance. I look forward to your response!\n\nElizabeth Marconi\n\n443-370-1248',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-01 00:47:30'),(266,'Teresa','Moore','teresamoorelt@gmail.com','4012012012','10032',NULL,'Hello,\nI would like to offer some suggestions for your website. No commitment for future work, fine print, or hidden anything - just an opportunity for you to see how we can improve your website and leads.\n\nWould it be ok to show you the suggestions I have in mind?\n\nPlease let me know!\n\nThank you!\nTeresa Moore',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-07 05:51:35'),(267,'Chloe','Terry','chloe@grandeurgreenservices.com','2403358224','21701',NULL,'I was checking out your facility the other day and would love an opportunity to provide you with a cleaning quote. We’re working with several facilities in your area and everyone seems to love our work because of our attention to detail. Are you free for a quick 10-minute call this week?\n\nCheers,\n\nChloe Terry\nBusiness Development Representative\nGrandeur Green Services\nchloe@grandeurgreenservices.com\n\nRespond with stop to optout.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-17 15:09:26'),(268,'Mari