INSERT INTO `text_content` VALUES (1,1,'content1','BasementRemodeling.com. You are safe with us.'),(2,1,'content2','High-end basement finishing and remodeling services in Maryland, Northern Virginia (NOVA) and Washington DC. Where top-notch quality meets endless possibilities. '),(3,1,'content3','Over a Thousand of Basements Finished'),(4,1,'content4','Check out our recent projects above or visit our portfolio to review all of the basements we remodeled during our 20 years in the industry.'),(5,1,'content5','Our news'),(6,1,'content6','BasementRemodeling.com was featured on House Smarts, which was aired on CNBC. This basement is located in Potomac, MD, and was completed by BasementRemodeling.com (ex- Basement Masters) during the Spring of 2019 for Mr. and Mrs. Terlinsky. Our whole team thanks Alan and Joan for the opportunity to make their dream basement come true.'),(7,1,'content7','Want to know what our past clients have to say about their basement remodeling experiences with BasementRemodeling.com?'),(8,1,'content8','We love our clients and they love us!'),(9,1,'content9','The overwhelmingly positive reception from our clients makes BasementRemodeling.com stand out from other basement remodeling companies in Maryland, Northern Virginia (NOVA) and DC. It definitely means something to us, and we think it should mean something to you, too!'),(10,1,'content10','Awards'),(11,1,'content11','BasementRemodeling.com is an award-winning basement remodeling and finishing company and one of the top remodeling companies in Maryland, DC, and Northern Virginia (NOVA).'),(12,1,'content12','Follow us on Instagram'),(13,1,'content13','Get inspired by the possibilities'),(14,1,'content14','Some of the many ways we could transform your basement. Aesthetically pleasing solutions that help you get most out of your space.'),(15,1,'content15','Upfront transparent predetermined pricing for every client'),(16,1,'content16','We have upfront & transparent pricing policy. No unexpected spendings.'),(17,1,'content17','Our Professional Project Management Approach'),(18,1,'content18','At BasementRemodeling.com, we have a unique project management approach to make sure every basement remodel is completed in a timely fashion with quality results. With an exceptionally organized timeline, we know precisely what is going on at the job site every single day, without fail. Unlike other basement remodeling companies, our process is completely transparent! Take a look at our basement remodeling timeline below to see just how informed you\'ll be through every step of the way.'),(19,1,'content19','Capable and Reliable Basement Remodeling and Finishing'),(20,1,'content20','Come visit our showroom and office in Rockville, MD to see our full flooring and cabinet selections! We want talk to you in person about your next project and show you around, so be sure to schedule an appointment in advance.'),(21,1,'content21','Service area'),(22,1,'content22','BasementRemodeling.com is a licensed and insured full service design-and-build remodeling company serving Washington DC, Maryland, and Northern Virginia (NOVA). Our headquarters and showroom are located in Rockville, MD, with warehouses located across the DMV area.'),(23,1,'content23','Why Choose BasementRemodeling.com'),(24,1,'content24','We are different than other basement remodeling companies:'),(25,1,'content25','Basement Remodel Financing Available'),(26,1,'content26','We’ve partnered with GreenSky Credit to offer excellent basement remodel financing options for free or at a low cost. You can instantly get basement remodel financing and enjoy a brand new basement in just a few weeks. Choose a basement remodel financing plan and apply for up to $55,000 right now. GreenSky Credit – the leading home improvement loans provider in the nation – offers a way to finally get basement finishing financing. No more tedious trips to the bank, no long approval processes, no additional paperwork required – just the capital you need to get basement remodel financing underway!'),(27,1,'content27','Licenses and Insurance'),(28,1,'content28','BasementRemodeling.com is a fully licensed and insured basement contractor in Maryland, Washington DC and Virginia. Our Virginia Class A Contractor License (VA Class A) number is 2705159425, our Maryland Home Improvement Commission License (MHIC) number is 129172 and our DC Class A Contractor License (DC Class A) number is 410516000631. We have posted copies of our basement remodeling licenses and insurance certificates below. Please note: any basement finishing or remodeling project requires a separate set of permits which should be pulled by a licensed contractor/electrician/plumber etc. You can easily check any contractors license here:'),(29,1,'content29','Basement Tips'),(30,13,'content30','<p>A basement is a great addition to any household, adding value to your property and giving your loved ones a place where they will all want to hang out and spend time together &ndash; not to mention entertain guests! Whether you are after a traditional basement with a fireplace and a casual atmosphere, a contemporary lounging area with chic furniture and dramatic angles, or an idea of a &nbsp;basement that&rsquo;s truly original, we have all of the materials and expertise necessary to make your basement ideas come true.</p>\n<p>On the other hand, if you have no basement ideas of your own, we will gladly create a basement that matches your exact lifestyle. From overstuffed sectional sofas to intimate loveseats, our design experts will choose the right sitting furniture based on your family&rsquo;s size and individual needs. Watch as coffee table centerpieces and other room accessories transform your downstairs dwelling from drab to fab. No matter what the size of the room, however, one thing always remains the same &ndash; a large screen HDTV and a stunning entertainment center for all to enjoy!</p>'),(31,13,'content31','Basement Ideas'),(32,1,'content32','March, 1st 2024'),(33,1,'content33','We are excited to announce that BasementRemodeling.com has made it onto <a href=\"https://www.inc.com/inc5000\" target=\"_blank\">Inc. Magazine List of 5000 Fastest-Growing Private Companies in America </a> second year in a row this time at spot  <a href=\"https://www.inc.com/profile/basementremodelingcom\" target=\"_blank\">4,307 </a>! We are proud to be the only Remodeling company specializing in basements to be included in the rankings. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBasementRemodeling.com once again made it onto <a href=\"https://www.qualifiedremodeler.com/top-500-2024/\" target=\"_blank\">QR 500 list - the annual ranking of the nation\'s largest remodeling firms </a> for 2024 at spot  <a href=\"https://www.qualifiedremodeler.com/firm/basement-remodeling/?y=2024\">262 </a>! We are proud to be the only Remodeling company specializing in basement finishing and remodeling to be included in the rankings. \r\n');
